{"model":"ornith-1.5","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nAs you answer the user's questions, you can use the following context:\n# claudeMd\nCodebase and user instructions are shown below. Be sure to adhere to these instructions. IMPORTANT: These instructions OVERRIDE any default behavior and you MUST follow them exactly as written.\n\nContents of /home/web-h-063/.claude/CLAUDE.md (user's private global instructions for all projects):\n\n## Orchestration Rules\n\nYou are an orchestrator, not a junior developer. Delegate instead of doing:\n\n- **Planning / Research** — spawn `Explore` or `general-purpose` agents to sweep files and understand the codebase. Don't read everything yourself.\n- **Writing specs** — use the `writing-plans-agent` agent type for multi-step tasks.\n- **Executing plans** — use the `executing-plans-agent` agent type for implemented plans with review checkpoints.\n- **Parallel work** — if multiple independent tasks exist, spawn agents concurrently instead of doing them sequentially.\n- **Context gathering** — use `Explore` to find relevant files before diving into implementation.\n\nYou still own the final output: synthesize agent results, make decisions, and present the conclusion. But the legwork is their job.\n# graphify\n- **graphify** (`~/.claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md`) - any input to knowledge graph. Trigger: `/graphify`\nWhen the user types `/graphify`, use the installed graphify skill or instructions before doing anything else.\n# currentDate\nToday's date is 2026-08-23.\n\n      IMPORTANT: this context may or may not be relevant to your tasks. You should not respond to this context unless it is highly relevant to your task.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<local-command-caveat>Caveat: The messages below were generated by the user while running local commands. DO NOT respond to these messages or otherwise consider them in your response unless the user explicitly asks you to.</local-command-caveat>\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<command-name>/model</command-name>\n            <command-message>model</command-message>\n            <command-args></command-args>\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<local-command-stdout>Current model: Minimax-M2.7 (effort: medium)\nUsage: /model <name>. Available: sonnet, opus, haiku, fable, best, sonnet[1m], opus[1m], fable[1m], opusplan, default, or a full model ID.</local-command-stdout>\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<local-command-caveat>Caveat: The messages below were generated by the user while running local commands. DO NOT respond to these messages or otherwise consider them in your response unless the user explicitly asks you to.</local-command-caveat>\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<command-name>/model</command-name>\n            <command-message>model</command-message>\n            <command-args>haiku</command-args>\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<local-command-stdout>Set model to ornith-1.5</local-command-stdout>\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<ide_opened_file>The user opened the file /home/web-h-063/Documents/anthropic_routing_gateway/inspect_server.py in the IDE. This may or may not be related to the current task.</ide_opened_file>"},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"can you read this image?"}]},{"role":"system","content":"SessionStart:startup hook success: PONYTAIL MODE ACTIVE — level: full\n\n# Ponytail\n\nYou are a lazy senior developer. Lazy means efficient, not careless. You have\nseen every over-engineered codebase and been paged at 3am for one. The best\ncode is the code never written.\n\n## Persistence\n\nACTIVE EVERY RESPONSE. No drift back to over-building. Still active if\nunsure. Off only: \"stop ponytail\" / \"normal mode\". Default: **full**.\nSwitch: `/ponytail lite|full|ultra`.\n\n## The ladder\n\nStop at the first rung that holds:\n\n1. **Does this need to exist at all?** Speculative need = skip it, say so in one line. (YAGNI)\n2. **Already in this codebase?** A helper, util, type, or pattern that already lives here → reuse it. Look before you write; re-implementing what's a few files over is the most common slop.\n3. **Stdlib does it?** Use it.\n4. **Native platform feature covers it?** `<input type=\"date\">` over a picker lib, CSS over JS, DB constraint over app code.\n5. **Already-installed dependency solves it?** Use it. Never add a new one for what a few lines can do.\n6. **Can it be one line?** One line.\n7. **Only then:** the minimum code that works.\n\nThe ladder is a reflex, not a research project — but it runs *after* you\nunderstand the problem, not instead of it. Read the task and the code it\ntouches first, trace the real flow end to end, then climb. Two rungs work →\ntake the higher one and move on. The first lazy solution that works is the\nright one — once you actually know what the change has to touch.\n\n**Bug fix = root cause, not symptom.** A report names a symptom. Before you\nedit, grep every caller of the function you're about to touch. The lazy fix IS\nthe root-cause fix: one guard in the shared function is a smaller diff than a\nguard in every caller — and patching only the path the ticket names leaves\nevery sibling caller still broken. Fix it once, where all callers route through.\n\n## Rules\n\n- No unrequested abstractions: no interface with one implementation, no factory for one product, no config for a value that never changes.\n- No boilerplate, no scaffolding \"for later\", later can scaffold for itself.\n- Deletion over addition. Boring over clever, clever is what someone decodes at 3am.\n- Fewest files possible. Shortest working diff wins — but only once you understand the problem. The smallest change in the wrong place isn't lazy, it's a second bug.\n- Complex request? Ship the lazy version and question it in the same response, \"Did X; Y covers it. Need full X? Say so.\" Never stall on an answer you can default.\n- Two stdlib options, same size? Take the one that's correct on edge cases. Lazy means writing less code, not picking the flimsier algorithm.\n- Mark deliberate simplifications with a `ponytail:` comment (`// ponytail: this exists`), simple reads as intent, not ignorance. Shortcut with a known ceiling (global lock, O(n²) scan, naive heuristic)? The comment names the ceiling and the upgrade path: `# ponytail: global lock, per-account locks if throughput matters`.\n\n## Output\n\nCode first. Then at most three short lines: what was skipped, when to add it.\nNo essays, no feature tours, no design notes. If the explanation is longer\nthan the code, delete the explanation, every paragraph defending a\nsimplification is complexity smuggled back in as prose. Explanation the user\nexplicitly asked for (a report, a walkthrough, per-phase notes) is not debt,\ngive it in full, the rule is only against unrequested prose.\n\nPattern: `[code] → skipped: [X], add when [Y].`\n\n## Intensity\n\n| Level | What change |\n|-------|------------|\n| **full** | The ladder enforced. Stdlib and native first. Shortest diff, shortest explanation. Default. |\n\nExample: \"Add a cache for these API responses.\"\n- full: \"`@lru_cache(maxsize=1000)` on the fetch function. Skipped custom cache class, add when lru_cache measurably falls short.\"\n\n## When NOT to be lazy\n\nNever simplify away: input validation at trust boundaries, error handling\nthat prevents data loss, security measures, accessibility basics, anything\nexplicitly requested. User insists on the full version → build it, no\nre-arguing.\n\nNever lazy about understanding the problem. The ladder shortens the\nsolution, never the reading. Trace the whole thing first — every file the\nchange touches, the actual flow — before picking a rung. Laziness that skips\ncomprehension to ship a small diff is the dangerous kind: it dresses up as\nefficiency and ships a confident wrong fix. Read fully, then be lazy.\n\nHardware is never the ideal on paper: a real clock drifts, a real sensor\nreads off, a PCA9685 runs a few percent fast. Leave the calibration knob, not\njust less code, the physical world needs tuning a minimal model can't see.\n\nLazy code without its check is unfinished. Non-trivial logic (a branch, a\nloop, a parser, a money/security path) leaves ONE runnable check behind, the\nsmallest thing that fails if the logic breaks: an `assert`-based\n`demo()`/`__main__` self-check or one small `test_*.py`. No frameworks, no\nfixtures, no per-function suites unless asked. Trivial one-liners need no\ntest, YAGNI applies to tests too.\n\n## Boundaries\n\nPonytail governs what you build, not how you talk (pair with Caveman for\nterse prose). \"stop ponytail\" / \"normal mode\": revert. Level persists until\nchanged or session end.\n\nThe shortest path to done is the right path.\n\nAvailable agent types for the Agent tool:\n- claude: Catch-all for any task that doesn't fit a more specific agent. FleetView's default when no agent name is typed. (Tools: *)\n- claude-code-guide: Use this agent when the user asks questions (\"Can Claude...\", \"Does Claude...\", \"How do I...\") about: (1) Claude Code (the CLI tool) - features, hooks, slash commands, MCP servers, settings, IDE integrations, keyboard shortcuts; (2) Claude Agent SDK - building custom agents; (3) Claude API (formerly Anthropic API) - Messages API for directly passing messages to Claude, Tool Runner (`client.beta.messages.tool_runner`) for running an agentic loop over your own tools, manual tool-use loops, Managed Agents for server-hosted agents with a managed sandbox, prompt caching, and general Anthropic SDK usage; (4) Claude Tag (Claude in Slack) - what it is, setting it up for a Slack workspace, `/install-slack-app`; (5) `claude plugin eval` (writing and running plugin eval suites, its JSON/report, sandbox, CI, early-access enablement) and the `/skill-doctor` report. **IMPORTANT:** Before spawning a new agent, check if there is already a running or recently completed claude-code-guide agent that you can continue via SendMessage. (Tools: Bash, Read, WebFetch, WebSearch)\n- executing-plans-agent: Use when you have a written implementation plan to execute in a separate session with review checkpoints (Tools: Read, Glob, Grep, Write, Edit, Bash)\n- Explore: Read-only search agent for broad fan-out searches — when answering means sweeping many files, directories, or naming conventions and you only need the conclusion, not the file dumps. It reads excerpts rather than whole files, so it locates code; it doesn't review or audit it. Specify search breadth: \"medium\" for moderate exploration, \"very thorough\" for multiple locations and naming conventions. (Tools: All tools except Agent, Artifact, ExitPlanMode, Edit, Write, NotebookEdit)\n- general-purpose: General-purpose agent for researching complex questions, searching for code, and executing multi-step tasks. When you are searching for a keyword or file and are not confident that you will find the right match in the first few tries use this agent to perform the search for you. (Tools: *)\n- Plan: Software architect agent for designing implementation plans. Use this when you need to plan the implementation strategy for a task. Returns step-by-step plans, identifies critical files, and considers architectural trade-offs. (Tools: All tools except Agent, Artifact, ExitPlanMode, Edit, Write, NotebookEdit)\n- statusline-setup: Use this agent to configure the user's Claude Code status line setting. (Tools: Read, Edit)\n- writing-plans-agent: Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code (Tools: Read, Glob, Grep, Write, Edit, Bash)\n\nWhen you launch multiple agents for independent work, send them in a single message with multiple tool uses so they run concurrently.\n\n# MCP Server Instructions\n\nThe following MCP servers have provided instructions for how to use their tools and resources:\n\n## serena\nCRITICAL: Before starting to work on a coding task, call the `initial_instructions` tool to read the 'Serena Instructions Manual'.\n\nThe following skills are available for use with the Skill tool:\n\n- agent-reach\n- baoyu-youtube-transcript\n- better-accessibility\n- better-colors\n- better-interface\n- better-layout\n- better-typography\n- better-ui\n- better-writing\n- brainstorming\n- design-taste-frontend\n- executing-plans\n- fastmcp-server\n- find-skills\n- frontend-design\n- graphify\n- hallmark\n- html-mockup-consistency\n- image-to-code\n- impeccable\n- intelligent-automation-auto-recording\n- intelligent-automation-identical-env-approach\n- intelligent-automation-v2\n- intelligent-automation-v2-new\n- naagmani-app-gen\n- officecli\n- orchestrating-claude-sessions\n- redesign-existing-projects\n- security-audit\n- shadcn\n- skill-creator\n- web-design-guidelines\n- wiki-manager\n- wren-usage\n- writing-plans\n- writing-skills\n- intelligent-automation\n- jobs-audit\n- organizations-audit\n- plans-audit\n- code-review:code-review\n- claude-md-management:revise-claude-md\n- claude-md-management:claude-md-improver\n- andrej-karpathy-skills:karpathy-guidelines\n- ponytail:ponytail\n- ponytail:ponytail-audit\n- ponytail:ponytail-debt\n- ponytail:ponytail-gain\n- ponytail:ponytail-help\n- ponytail:ponytail-review\n- officecli:officecli\n- dataviz: Use this skill whenever you are about to create ANY chart, graph, plot, dashboard, or data visualization, in ANY output medium — an HTML or React artifact, inline SVG, plotting code in any library (matplotlib, plotly, d3, Recharts, …), an image/PNG you will render and upload, or a chart shared into Slack. Read it BEFORE writing the first line of chart code, choosing chart colors, building a stat tile / meter / KPI row, or laying out a dashboard. Produces visualizations that read as one system — elegant, accessible, consistent in light and dark — using a brand-neutral placeholder palette you swap for your own. Teaches a design-system-agnostic method: a form heuristic, a color formula with a runnable validator, mark specs, and interaction rules. A validated default palette is documented in `references/palette.md` — swap that file's values for your brand's. Triggers on: \"chart\", \"graph\", \"plot\", \"data viz\", \"visualization\", \"dashboard\", \"analytics\", \"visualize data\", \"categorical colors\", \"sequential / diverging palette\", \"stat tile\", \"sparkline\", \"heatmap\", \"legend\", \"axis\", \"tooltip\", \"chart colors\", \"color by series\".\n- update-config: Use this skill to configure the Claude Code harness via settings.json. Automated behaviors (\"from now on when X\", \"each time X\", \"whenever X\", \"before/after X\") require hooks configured in settings.json - the harness executes these, not Claude, so memory/preferences cannot fulfill them. Also use for: permissions (\"allow X\", \"add permission\", \"move permission to\"), env vars (\"set X=Y\"), hook troubleshooting, or any changes to settings.json/settings.local.json files. Examples: \"allow npm commands\", \"add bq permission to global settings\", \"move permission to user settings\", \"set DEBUG=true\", \"when claude stops show X\". For simple settings like theme/model, suggest the /config command.\n- keybindings-help: Use when the user wants to customize keyboard shortcuts, rebind keys, add chord bindings, or modify ~/.claude/keybindings.json. Examples: \"rebind ctrl+s\", \"add a chord shortcut\", \"change the submit key\", \"customize keybindings\".\n- simplify: Review the changed code for reuse, simplification, efficiency, and altitude cleanups, then apply the fixes. Quality only — it does not hunt for bugs; use /code-review for that.\n- fewer-permission-prompts: Scan your transcripts for common read-only Bash and MCP tool calls, then add a prioritized allowlist to project .claude/settings.json to reduce permission prompts.\n- loop: Run a prompt or slash command on a recurring interval (e.g. /loop 5m /foo, defaults to 10m) - When the user wants to set up a recurring task, poll for status, or run something repeatedly on an interval (e.g. \"check the deploy every 5 minutes\", \"keep running /babysit-prs\"). Do NOT invoke for one-off tasks.\n- claude-api: Reference for the Claude API / Anthropic SDK — model ids, pricing, params, streaming, tool use, MCP, agents, caching, token counting, model migration.\nTRIGGER — read BEFORE opening the target file; don't skip because it \"looks like a one-liner\" — whenever: the prompt names Claude/Anthropic in any form (Claude, Anthropic, Fable, Opus, Sonnet, Haiku, `anthropic`, `@anthropic-ai`, `claude-*`, `us.anthropic.*`, `[1m]`); the user asks about an LLM (pricing/model choice/limits/caching) — never answer from memory; OR the task is LLM-shaped with provider unstated (agent/MCP/tool-definition/multi-agent/RAG/LLM-judge/computer-use; generate/summarize/extract/classify/rewrite/converse over NL; debugging refusals/cutoffs/streaming/tool-calls/tokens).\nSKIP only when another provider is being worked on (overrides all triggers): OpenAI/GPT/Gemini/Llama/Mistral/Cohere/Ollama named in the query; OR `grep -rE 'openai|langchain_openai|google.generativeai|genai|mistralai|cohere|ollama'` over the project hits (run this grep FIRST if no provider named — don't Read the file).\n- run: Launch and drive this project's app to see a change working. Use when asked to run, start, or screenshot the app, or to confirm a change works in the real app (not just tests). First looks for a project skill that already covers launching the app; otherwise falls back to built-in patterns per project type (CLI, server, TUI, Electron, browser-driven, library).\n- init\n- security-review\n\n<total_tokens>15000000 tokens left</total_tokens>"},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user asked \"can you read this image?\" — but this is a screenshot shared in the conversation. I can see it's a screenshot of the Explainer Bot UI (localhost:8255). Let me respond to confirm I can see it.\n","signature":"bb437d1e7b4c457c9ad99f13edf72a75"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nYes — I can read it. This is a screenshot of your **Explainer Bot** web app running at `localhost:8255`.\n\nWhat I can see:\n\n- **Left sidebar** — the \"Explainer Bot\" workspace with a project list:\n  - \"Gpt driver mcp server\" project open\n  - A chat history item \"Can you explain what machine learning is?\"\n  - A long list of older messages (mostly \"hello\")\n- **Main chat area** — \"QA Automation\"\n  - User message: *\"Can you explain what machine learning is?\"*\n  - A full explanation response covering supervised/unsupervised/reinforcement learning\n  - An orange **\"Listen Explanation\"** button (text-to-speech playback)\n  - Collapse/toggle controls (\"Thought Process\", playback speed 1x, \"Script\")\n- **Browser tabs** — a bunch of open tabs: ablation model, Ornith-1.5, QA Automation, Vast.ai console, Slack team-ai channel, Vane Annotate Image, etc.\n- The model is set to **Ornith-1.5** (haiku) per the terminal context.\n\nI can also see your IDE has [inspect_server.py](home/web-h-063/Documents/anthropic_routing_gateway/inspect_server.py) open in the editor.\n\nWhat would you like me to do with this?"}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"so the FE i just show you it's in here - /home/web-h-063/Documents/explainer-bot/index.html\n\nso read it so you understand how it works"}]},{"role":"system","content":"<total_tokens>15000000 tokens left</total_tokens>"},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to read the frontend file to understand how it works. Let me read it.\n","signature":"30e24379776e4b1eaab6350778802726"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6b6a66262348390","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/web-h-063/Documents/explainer-bot/index.html"}}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6b6a66262348390","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t<!DOCTYPE html>\n2\t<html lang=\"en\" class=\"dark\">\n3\t<head>\n4\t  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n5\t  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n6\t  <title>QA Automation Studio</title>\n7\t  \n8\t  <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n9\t  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n10\t  \n11\t  <!-- Fonts: Inter & JetBrains Mono -->\n12\t  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n13\t  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n14\t  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n15\t  \n16\t  <!-- Markdown & Code Highlighting Libraries -->\n17\t  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/marked/marked.min.js\"></script>\n18\t  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/highlight.js/11.9.0/styles/tokyo-night-dark.min.css\">\n19\t  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/highlight.js/11.9.0/highlight.min.js\"></script>\n20\t\n21\t  <script>\n22\t    tailwind.config = {\n23\t      darkMode: 'class',\n24\t      theme: {\n25\t        extend: {\n26\t          colors: {\n27\t            brand: {\n28\t              DEFAULT: '#f16913',\n29\t              hover: '#ff7b25',\n30\t              glow: 'rgba(241, 105, 19, 0.15)',\n31\t              border: 'rgba(241, 105, 19, 0.3)',\n32\t            },\n33\t            dark: {\n34\t              bg: '#0c0d10',\n35\t              surface: '#14151a',\n36\t              elevated: '#1c1e26',\n37\t              border: '#2a2d37',\n38\t              muted: '#343846',\n39\t            },\n40\t            txt: {\n41\t              main: '#f3f4f6',\n42\t              muted: '#9ca3af',\n43\t              subtle: '#6b7280',\n44\t            }\n45\t          },\n46\t          fontFamily: {\n47\t            sans: ['Inter', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],\n48\t            mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n49\t          },\n50\t          boxShadow: {\n51\t            'glow': '0 0 20px rgba(241, 105, 19, 0.15)',\n52\t            'card-glow': '0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)',\n53\t          }\n54\t        },\n55\t      },\n56\t    }\n57\t  </script>\n58\t\n59\t  <style>\n60\t    /* Global Reset & Glassmorphism */\n61\t    body {\n62\t      background-color: #0c0d10;\n63\t      color: #f3f4f6;\n64\t      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n65\t      overflow: hidden;\n66\t    }\n67\t\n68\t    /* Ambient background glow */\n69\t    .bg-ambient {\n70\t      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(241, 105, 19, 0.08) 0%, transparent 60%),\n71\t                  radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%, rgba(20, 21, 26, 0.8) 0%, transparent 50%);\n72\t    }\n73\t\n74\t    /* Custom Matching Scrollbar */\n75\t    ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n76\t      width: 6px;\n77\t      height: 6px;\n78\t    }\n79\t    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n80\t      background: transparent;\n81\t    }\n82\t    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n83\t      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n84\t      border-radius: 9999px;\n85\t    }\n86\t    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n87\t      background: rgba(241, 105, 19, 0.5);\n88\t    }\n89\t    * {\n90\t      scrollbar-width: thin;\n91\t      scrollbar-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) transparent;\n92\t    }\n93\t\n94\t    /* Markdown styling inside assistant messages */\n95\t    .prose-dark {\n96\t      color: #e5e7eb;\n97\t      font-size: 0.925rem;\n98\t      line-height: 1.6;\n99\t      word-break: break-word;\n100\t      overflow-wrap: break-word;\n101\t      max-width: 100%;\n102\t    }\n103\t    .prose-dark p {\n104\t      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n105\t    }\n106\t    .prose-dark p:last-child {\n107\t      margin-bottom: 0;\n108\t    }\n109\t    .prose-dark h1, .prose-dark h2, .prose-dark h3, .prose-dark h4 {\n110\t      color: #ffffff;\n111\t      font-weight: 600;\n112\t      margin-top: 1rem;\n113\t      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n114\t      word-break: break-word;\n115\t    }\n116\t    .prose-dark ul {\n117\t      list-style-type: disc;\n118\t      padding-left: 1.25rem;\n119\t      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n120\t    }\n121\t    .prose-dark ol {\n122\t      list-style-type: decimal;\n123\t      padding-left: 1.25rem;\n124\t      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n125\t    }\n126\t    .prose-dark li {\n127\t      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n128\t      word-break: break-word;\n129\t    }\n130\t    .prose-dark code:not(pre code) {\n131\t      background: #2a2d37;\n132\t      color: #f16913;\n133\t      padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;\n134\t      border-radius: 0.25rem;\n135\t      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n136\t      font-size: 0.825em;\n137\t      word-break: break-all;\n138\t    }\n139\t    .prose-dark pre {\n140\t      background: #14151a !important;\n141\t      border: 1px solid #2a2d37;\n142\t      border-radius: 0.5rem;\n143\t      margin: 0.75rem 0;\n144\t      position: relative;\n145\t      overflow-x: auto;\n146\t      max-width: 100%;\n147\t    }\n148\t    .prose-dark pre code {\n149\t      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n150\t      font-size: 0.825rem;\n151\t      padding: 1rem !important;\n152\t      display: block;\n153\t      overflow-x: auto;\n154\t      white-space: pre;\n155\t    }\n156\t    .prose-dark table {\n157\t      width: 100%;\n158\t      border-collapse: collapse;\n159\t      margin: 0.75rem 0;\n160\t      font-size: 0.85rem;\n161\t      display: block;\n162\t      overflow-x: auto;\n163\t      max-width: 100%;\n164\t    }\n165\t    .prose-dark th {\n166\t      background-color: #1c1e26;\n167\t      color: #ffffff;\n168\t      font-weight: 600;\n169\t      text-align: left;\n170\t      padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;\n171\t      border: 1px solid #2a2d37;\n172\t    }\n173\t    .prose-dark td {\n174\t      padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;\n175\t      border: 1px solid #2a2d37;\n176\t    }\n177\t    .prose-dark tr:nth-child(even) {\n178\t      background-color: rgba(28, 30, 38, 0.4);\n179\t    }\n180\t\n181\t    /* Message animation */\n182\t    @keyframes slideUpFade {\n183\t      from {\n184\t        opacity: 0;\n185\t        transform: translateY(8px);\n186\t      }\n187\t      to {\n188\t        opacity: 1;\n189\t        transform: translateY(0);\n190\t      }\n191\t    }\n192\t    .animate-msg {\n193\t      animation: slideUpFade 0.25s ease-out forwards;\n194\t    }\n195\t\n196\t    /* Typing Dots Animation */\n197\t    @keyframes dotPulse {\n198\t      0%, 80%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scale(0.8); }\n199\t      40% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.1); }\n200\t    }\n201\t    .pulse-dot {\n202\t      animation: dotPulse 1.4s infinite ease-in-out both;\n203\t    }\n204\t    .pulse-dot:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: -0.32s; }\n205\t    .pulse-dot:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: -0.16s; }\n206\t  </style>\n207\t</head>\n208\t<body class=\"bg-dark-bg text-txt-main h-screen flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-brand selection:text-white\">\n209\t  \n210\t  <div class=\"flex h-full w-full bg-ambient relative overflow-hidden\">\n211\t    \n212\t    <!-- Mobile Sidebar Backdrop -->\n213\t    <div id=\"sidebar-backdrop\" class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-black/60 z-30 hidden lg:hidden backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity\"></div>\n214\t\n215\t    <!-- Sidebar -->\n216\t    <aside id=\"sidebar\" class=\"fixed inset-y-0 left-0 z-40 w-72 bg-dark-surface/95 backdrop-blur-md border-r border-dark-border flex flex-col shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 -translate-x-full lg:translate-x-0 lg:static\">\n217\t      \n218\t      <!-- App Brand Row -->\n219\t      <div class=\"p-3 border-b border-dark-border flex items-center justify-between\">\n220\t        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n221\t          <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-brand to-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-glow text-dark-bg font-bold\">\n222\t            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n223\t              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"/>\n224\t            </svg>\n225\t          </div>\n226\t          <div>\n227\t            <span class=\"font-semibold text-xs text-white\">Explainer Bot</span>\n228\t            <span class=\"text-[9px] text-txt-subtle block font-mono\">Workspace Studio</span>\n229\t          </div>\n230\t        </div>\n231\t      </div>\n232\t\n233\t      <!-- Projects Section Header with Expand/Collapse & Add Project -->\n234\t      <div class=\"px-3 pt-3 pb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-semibold text-txt-subtle uppercase tracking-wider\">\n235\t        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n236\t          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-txt-subtle\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n237\t            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z\"/>\n238\t          </svg>\n239\t          <span>Projects</span>\n240\t        </div>\n241\t        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n242\t          <button id=\"expand-all-btn\" title=\"Expand all projects\" class=\"p-1 rounded hover:bg-dark-elevated hover:text-white text-txt-subtle transition-colors flex items-center justify-center\" aria-label=\"Expand all\">\n243\t            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n244\t              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/>\n245\t            </svg>\n246\t          </button>\n247\t          <button id=\"collapse-all-btn\" title=\"Collapse all projects\" class=\"p-1 rounded hover:bg-dark-elevated hover:text-white text-txt-subtle transition-colors flex items-center justify-center\" aria-label=\"Collapse all\">\n248\t            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n249\t              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 15l7-7 7 7\"/>\n250\t            </svg>\n251\t          </button>\n252\t          <button id=\"add-project-btn\" title=\"Add project by path\" class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-dark-elevated hover:bg-dark-border text-txt-subtle hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] normal-case font-medium border border-dark-border ml-0.5\">\n253\t            <svg class=\"w-3 h-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n254\t              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 4v16m8-8H4\"/>\n255\t            </svg>\n256\t            <span>Add</span>\n257\t          </button>\n258\t        </div>\n259\t      </div>\n260\t\n261\t      <!-- Add Project Inline Form (Hidden by default) -->\n262\t      <div id=\"add-project-form\" class=\"mx-3 my-2 p-2.5 bg-dark-elevated/90 border border-brand/40 rounded-xl space-y-2 text-xs hidden animate-msg\">\n263\t        <div class=\"font-medium text-[11px] text-white flex items-center justify-between\">\n264\t          <span>Add Project</span>\n265\t          <button id=\"cancel-add-project-btn\" class=\"text-txt-subtle hover:text-white text-sm leading-none\">&times;</button>\n266\t        </div>\n267\t        <input id=\"new-project-path-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"/path/to/project\" class=\"w-full bg-dark-bg border border-dark-border rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-white font-mono placeholder:text-txt-subtle focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-border\" />\n268\t        <input id=\"new-project-name-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Project name (optional)\" class=\"w-full bg-dark-bg border border-dark-border rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-white placeholder:text-txt-subtle focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-border\" />\n269\t        <button id=\"submit-add-project-btn\" class=\"w-full bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white text-[11px] font-medium py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-glow\">Track Project</button>\n270\t      </div>\n271\t\n272\t      <!-- Projects & Sessions Tree Container -->\n273\t      <div id=\"projects-container\" class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-2 py-1 space-y-1.5\"></div>\n274\t\n275\t    </aside>\n276\t\n277\t    <!-- Main Workspace -->\n278\t    <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-w-0 h-full relative overflow-hidden\">\n279\t      \n280\t      <!-- Unified Header Bar -->\n281\t      <header class=\"h-12 px-3 sm:px-5 border-b border-dark-border/60 bg-dark-surface/40 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-between shrink-0\">\n282\t        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n283\t          <button id=\"menu-toggle\" class=\"lg:hidden p-1.5 text-txt-muted hover:text-white rounded-lg bg-dark-elevated border border-dark-border\" title=\"Toggle menu\">\n284\t            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n285\t              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"/>\n286\t            </svg>\n287\t          </button>\n288\t          <span class=\"font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm text-white tracking-wide\">QA Automation</span>\n289\t        </div>\n290\t\n291\t        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n292\t          <button id=\"settings-btn\" title=\"Settings\" class=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-dark-elevated hover:bg-dark-border border border-dark-border text-txt-muted hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center justify-center\">\n293\t            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n294\t              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" d=\"M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z\"/>\n295\t              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" d=\"M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n296\t            </svg>\n297\t          </button>\n298\t        </div>\n299\t      </header>\n300\t\n301\t      <!-- Chat Messages Scroll Container -->\n302\t      <div id=\"messages-container\" class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto overflow-x-hidden p-3 sm:p-5 pb-32 sm:pb-36 space-y-4 w-full min-w-0\">\n303\t        \n304\t        <!-- Empty State -->\n305\t        <div id=\"empty-state\" class=\"h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center my-auto py-10 w-full max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n306\t          <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand/20 to-amber-500/10 border border-brand-border flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-glow\">\n307\t            <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-brand\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n308\t              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" d=\"M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z\"/>\n309\t            </svg>\n310\t          </div>\n311\t          <h2 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-1.5\">What would you like to explore?</h2>\n312\t          <p class=\"text-txt-muted text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-md mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n313\t            Ask questions, run automation workflows, or explore spoken AI explanations.\n314\t          </p>\n315\t\n316\t          <!-- Prompt Cards -->\n317\t          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 w-full max-w-md\">\n318\t            <button class=\"prompt-chip text-left p-3 rounded-xl bg-dark-surface hover:bg-dark-elevated border border-dark-border hover:border-brand-border transition-all duration-200 group\">\n319\t              <div class=\"font-medium text-xs text-white group-hover:text-brand mb-0.5\">What skills do you have?</div>\n320\t              <div class=\"text-[11px] text-txt-subtle truncate\">List all installed capabilities</div>\n321\t            </button>\n322\t            <button class=\"prompt-chip text-left p-3 rounded-xl bg-dark-surface hover:bg-dark-elevated border border-dark-border hover:border-brand-border transition-all duration-200 group\">\n323\t              <div class=\"font-medium text-xs text-white group-hover:text-brand mb-0.5\">Explain Machine Learning</div>\n324\t              <div class=\"text-[11px] text-txt-subtle truncate\">Get a clear explanation with voice audio</div>\n325\t            </button>\n326\t          </div>\n327\t        </div>\n328\t\n329\t      </div>\n330\t\n331\t      <!-- Floating Input Container -->\n332\t      <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-20 pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-dark-bg via-dark-bg/85 to-transparent pt-8 pb-3 px-3 sm:pb-4 sm:px-4\">\n333\t        <div class=\"w-full max-w-2xl lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto min-w-0\">\n334\t          <div class=\"pointer-events-auto relative rounded-xl bg-dark-surface/95 backdrop-blur-xl border border-dark-border focus-within:border-brand/60 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-150 px-3 py-2\">\n335\t            \n336\t            <textarea\n337\t              id=\"message-input\"\n338\t              rows=\"1\"\n339\t              placeholder=\"Type a message or prompt...\"\n340\t              class=\"w-full bg-transparent px-0.5 py-0.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-txt-main placeholder-txt-subtle focus:outline-none resize-none max-h-32 font-sans leading-relaxed block overflow-y-auto min-h-[22px]\"\n341\t            ></textarea>\n342\t\n343\t            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-1 mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-txt-subtle\">\n344\t              <!-- Left side: Context usage progress bar -->\n345\t              <div id=\"context-usage-bar\" class=\"hidden items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer font-mono text-[11px] select-none text-brand hover:brightness-110 transition-all\" onclick=\"showContextModal()\" title=\"View context breakdown\">\n346\t                <span class=\"text-brand font-bold\">[</span>\n347\t                <span id=\"context-usage-blocks\" class=\"tracking-tight inline-flex leading-none\"></span>\n348\t                <span class=\"text-brand font-bold\">]</span>\n349\t                <span id=\"context-usage-label\" class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-brand font-medium\">0%</span>\n350\t              </div>\n351\t              <div class=\"flex-1\"></div>\n352\t\n353\t              <button\n354\t                id=\"send-btn\"\n355\t                disabled\n356\t                title=\"Send message\"\n357\t                class=\"bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white p-1.5 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-150 disabled:opacity-25 disabled:hover:bg-brand shadow-sm active:scale-95 shrink-0\"\n358\t              >\n359\t                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n360\t                  <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"/>\n361\t                </svg>\n362\t              </button>\n363\t            </div>\n364\t\n365\t          </div>\n366\t        </div>\n367\t      </div>\n368\t\n369\t    </main>\n370\t\n371\t  </div>\n372\t\n373\t  <!-- JavaScript Logic -->\n374\t  <script>\n375\t    // ============== Setup Markdown Renderer ==============\n376\t    marked.setOptions({\n377\t      highlight: function(code, lang) {\n378\t        if (lang && hljs.getLanguage(lang)) {\n379\t          return hljs.highlight(code, { language: lang }).value;\n380\t        }\n381\t        return hljs.highlightAuto(code).value;\n382\t      },\n383\t      breaks: true\n384\t    });\n385\t\n386\t    // Helper to get initial setting_sources\n387\t    function getInitialSettingSources() {\n388\t      const stored = localStorage.getItem('qa-setting-sources');\n389\t      if (stored === 'user') return ['user'];\n390\t      if (stored === 'local') return ['local'];\n391\t      if (stored && stored.startsWith('[')) {\n392\t        try { return JSON.parse(stored); } catch(e) { return null; }\n393\t      }\n394\t      return null;\n395\t    }\n396\t\n397\t    // ============== State Management ==============\n398\t    const state = {\n399\t      currentThreadId: localStorage.getItem('qa-chat-current-thread') || null,\n400\t      activeProjectId: localStorage.getItem('qa-active-project-id') ? parseInt(localStorage.getItem('qa-active-project-id'), 10) : null,\n401\t      projects: [],\n402\t      projectSessions: {},\n403\t      expandedProjects: new Set(),\n404\t      loadingProjects: new Set(),\n405\t      messages: {},\n406\t      sessionCursors: {},\n407\t      isLoadingOlder: {},\n408\t      speechExplanation: localStorage.getItem('qa-speech-explanation') === 'true',\n409\t      settingSources: getInitialSettingSources(),\n410\t      skillsMode: localStorage.getItem('qa-skills-mode') === 'all' ? 'default' : (localStorage.getItem('qa-skills-mode') || 'default'),\n411\t      skillsList: JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('qa-skills-list') || '[]'),\n412\t      permissionMode: localStorage.getItem('qa-permission-mode') || null,\n413\t      contextUsage: null,\n414\t      isStreaming: false,\n415\t      abortController: null,\n416\t    };\n417\t\n418\t    function setCurrentThread(threadId) {\n419\t      state.currentThreadId = threadId;\n420\t      if (threadId) {\n421\t        localStorage.setItem('qa-chat-current-thread', threadId);\n422\t      } else {\n423\t        localStorage.removeItem('qa-chat-current-thread');\n424\t      }\n425\t    }\n426\t\n427\t    function getSessionMessages(threadId) {\n428\t      return state.messages[threadId] || [];\n429\t    }\n430\t\n431\t    // ============== Elements Reference ==============\n432\t    const el = {\n433\t      sidebar: document.getElementById('sidebar'),\n434\t      sidebarBackdrop: document.getElementById('sidebar-backdrop'),\n435\t      projectsContainer: document.getElementById('projects-container'),\n436\t      expandAllBtn: document.getElementById('expand-all-btn'),\n437\t      collapseAllBtn: document.getElementById('collapse-all-btn'),\n438\t      addProjectBtn: document.getElementById('add-project-btn'),\n439\t      addProjectForm: document.getElementById('add-project-form'),\n440\t      newProjectPathInput: document.getElementById('new-project-path-input'),\n441\t      newProjectNameInput: document.getElementById('new-project-name-input'),\n442\t      submitAddProjectBtn: document.getElementById('submit-add-project-btn'),\n443\t      cancelAddProjectBtn: document.getElementById('cancel-add-project-btn'),\n444\t      messagesContainer: document.getElementById('messages-container'),\n445\t      emptyState: document.getElementById('empty-state'),\n446\t      messageInput: document.getElementById('message-input'),\n447\t      sendBtn: document.getElementById('send-btn'),\n448\t      menuToggle: document.getElementById('menu-toggle'),\n449\t      settingsBtn: document.getElementById('settings-btn'),\n450\t      contextUsageBar: document.getElementById('context-usage-bar'),\n451\t      contextUsageBlocks: document.getElementById('context-usage-blocks'),\n452\t      contextUsageLabel: document.getElementById('context-usage-label'),\n453\t    };\n454\t\n455\t    // ============== Projects & Sessions API ==============\n456\t    async function loadProjects() {\n457\t      try {\n458\t        const res = await fetch('/api/projects');\n459\t        if (!res.ok) return;\n460\t        const data = await res.json();\n461\t        state.projects = data.projects || [];\n462\t\n463\t        // If no projects tracked yet, auto-add default workspace as initial project\n464\t        if (state.projects.length === 0) {\n465\t          try {\n466\t            const wsRes = await fetch('/api/workspace');\n467\t            if (wsRes.ok) {\n468\t              const wsData = await wsRes.json();\n469\t              const defaultPath = wsData.workspace || '.';\n470\t              const name = defaultPath.split('/').filter(Boolean).pop() || 'Default Project';\n471\t              const createRes = await fetch('/api/projects', {\n472\t                method: 'POST',\n473\t                headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n474\t                body: JSON.stringify({ name, path: defaultPath })\n475\t              });\n476\t              if (createRes.ok) {\n477\t                const newProj = await createRes.json();\n478\t                state.projects = [newProj];\n479\t              }\n480\t            }\n481\t          } catch (err) {\n482\t            console.error('Failed to auto-add default project:', err);\n483\t          }\n484\t        }\n485\t\n486\t        // Auto-expand active or first project\n487\t        if (state.projects.length > 0) {\n488\t          const activeProj = state.projects.find(p => p.id === state.activeProjectId) || state.projects[0];\n489\t          if (activeProj) {\n490\t            state.activeProjectId = activeProj.id;\n491\t            localStorage.setItem('qa-active-project-id', activeProj.id);\n492\t            state.expandedProjects.add(activeProj.id);\n493\t            await loadProjectSessions(activeProj.id);\n494\t          }\n495\t        }\n496\t\n497\t        renderProjects();\n498\t      } catch (e) {\n499\t        console.error('Failed to load projects:', e);\n500\t      }\n501\t    }\n502\t\n503\t    async function loadProjectSessions(projectId) {\n504\t      try {\n505\t        const res = await fetch(`/api/projects/${projectId}/sessions`);\n506\t        if (res.ok) {\n507\t          const data = await res.json();\n508\t          state.projectSessions[projectId] = data.sessions || [];\n509\t        } else {\n510\t          state.projectSessions[projectId] = [];\n511\t        }\n512\t      } catch (e) {\n513\t        console.error('Failed to load project sessions:', e);\n514\t        state.projectSessions[projectId] = [];\n515\t      }\n516\t    }\n517\t\n518\t    async function addNewProject(name, path) {\n519\t      if (!path || !path.trim()) {\n520\t        showNotification('Please provide a valid project directory path', 'error');\n521\t        return false;\n522\t      }\n523\t      const cleanPath = path.trim();\n524\t      const projName = (name && name.trim()) ? name.trim() : (cleanPath.split('/').filter(Boolean).pop() || 'Project');\n525\t\n526\t      try {\n527\t        const res = await fetch('/api/projects', {\n528\t          method: 'POST',\n529\t          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n530\t          body: JSON.stringify({ name: projName, path: cleanPath })\n531\t        });\n532\t\n533\t        const data = await res.json();\n534\t        if (!res.ok) {\n535\t          showNotification(data.detail || 'Failed to add project', 'error');\n536\t          return false;\n537\t        }\n538\t\n539\t        state.projects.unshift(data);\n540\t        state.activeProjectId = data.id;\n541\t        localStorage.setItem('qa-active-project-id', data.id);\n542\t        state.expandedProjects.add(data.id);\n543\t        await loadProjectSessions(data.id);\n544\t        renderProjects();\n545\t        startNewChat();\n546\t        showNotification(`Project \"${projName}\" added`, 'success');\n547\t        return true;\n548\t      } catch (e) {\n549\t        showNotification(e.message || 'Failed to add project', 'error');\n550\t        return false;\n551\t      }\n552\t    }\n553\t\n554\t    async function deleteProject(projectId) {\n555\t      try {\n556\t        const res = await fetch(`/api/projects/${projectId}`, { method: 'DELETE' });\n557\t        if (res.ok) {\n558\t          state.projects = state.projects.filter(p => p.id !== projectId);\n559\t          state.expandedProjects.delete(projectId);\n560\t          delete state.projectSessions[projectId];\n561\t          if (state.activeProjectId === projectId) {\n562\t            if (state.projects.length > 0) {\n563\t              state.activeProjectId = state.projects[0].id;\n564\t              localStorage.setItem('qa-active-project-id', state.projects[0].id);\n565\t              state.expandedProjects.add(state.projects[0].id);\n566\t              await loadProjectSessions(state.projects[0].id);\n567\t            } else {\n568\t              state.activeProjectId = null;\n569\t              localStorage.removeItem('qa-active-project-id');\n570\t            }\n571\t          }\n572\t          renderProjects();\n573\t          showNotification('Project removed from tracking', 'info');\n574\t        }\n575\t      } catch (e) {\n576\t        showNotification('Failed to remove project', 'error');\n577\t      }\n578\t    }\n579\t\n580\t    async function toggleProject(projectId) {\n581\t      const proj = state.projects.find(p => p.id === projectId);\n582\t      if (proj) {\n583\t        state.activeProjectId = proj.id;\n584\t        localStorage.setItem('qa-active-project-id', proj.id);\n585\t      }\n586\t\n587\t      if (state.expandedProjects.has(projectId)) {\n588\t        state.expandedProjects.delete(projectId);\n589\t        renderProjects();\n590\t      } else {\n591\t        state.expandedProjects.add(projectId);\n592\t        if (!state.projectSessions[projectId]) {\n593\t          state.loadingProjects.add(projectId);\n594\t          renderProjects();\n595\t          await loadProjectSessions(projectId);\n596\t          state.loadingProjects.delete(projectId);\n597\t        }\n598\t        renderProjects();\n599\t      }\n600\t    }\n601\t\n602\t    async function expandAllProjects() {\n603\t      const toLoad = [];\n604\t      state.projects.forEach(p => {\n605\t        state.expandedProjects.add(p.id);\n606\t        if (!state.projectSessions[p.id]) {\n607\t          state.loadingProjects.add(p.id);\n608\t          toLoad.push(loadProjectSessions(p.id).then(() => state.loadingProjects.delete(p.id)));\n609\t        }\n610\t      });\n611\t      renderProjects();\n612\t      if (toLoad.length > 0) {\n613\t        await Promise.all(toLoad);\n614\t        renderProjects();\n615\t      }\n616\t    }\n617\t\n618\t    function collapseAllProjects() {\n619\t      state.expandedProjects.clear();\n620\t      renderProjects();\n621\t    }\n622\t\n623\t    // ============== Streaming Logic ==============\n624\t    async function* streamChat(message, threadId, signal) {\n625\t      let skillsPayload = null;\n626\t      if (state.skillsMode === 'none') {\n627\t        skillsPayload = [];\n628\t      } else if (state.skillsMode === 'custom') {\n629\t        skillsPayload = Array.isArray(state.skillsList) ? state.skillsList : [];\n630\t      }\n631\t\n632\t      const response = await fetch('/api/chat', {\n633\t        method: 'POST',\n634\t        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n635\t        body: JSON.stringify({ \n636\t          message, \n637\t          thread_id: threadId,\n638\t          project_id: state.activeProjectId || null,\n639\t          speech_explanation: Boolean(state.speechExplanation),\n640\t          setting_sources: state.settingSources,\n641\t          skills: skillsPayload,\n642\t          permission_mode: state.permissionMode,\n643\t        }),\n644\t        signal,\n645\t      });\n646\t\n647\t      if (!response.ok) {\n648\t        throw new Error(`Server returned error ${response.status}`);\n649\t      }\n650\t\n651\t      const reader = response.body.getReader();\n652\t      const decoder = new TextDecoder();\n653\t      let buffer = '';\n654\t\n655\t      try {\n656\t        while (true) {\n657\t          const { done, value } = await reader.read();\n658\t          if (done) break;\n659\t\n660\t          buffer += decoder.decode(value, { stream: true });\n661\t          const parts = buffer.split('\\n\\n');\n662\t          buffer = parts.pop() || '';\n663\t\n664\t          for (const part of parts) {\n665\t            const lines = part.split('\\n');\n666\t            let currentEvent = null;\n667\t            let eventData = null;\n668\t\n669\t            for (const line of lines) {\n670\t              if (line.startsWith('event: ')) {\n671\t                currentEvent = line.slice(7).trim();\n672\t              } else if (line.startsWith('data: ')) {\n673\t                try {\n674\t                  eventData = JSON.parse(line.slice(6).trim());\n675\t                } catch (e) {}\n676\t              }\n677\t            }\n678\t\n679\t            if (currentEvent && eventData !== null) {\n680\t              yield { event: currentEvent, data: eventData };\n681\t            }\n682\t          }\n683\t        }\n684\t      } finally {\n685\t        reader.releaseLock();\n686\t      }\n687\t    }\n688\t\n689\t    // ============== Render Functions ==============\n690\t    function renderProjects() {\n691\t      if (!el.projectsContainer) return;\n692\t\n693\t      if (!state.projects || state.projects.length === 0) {\n694\t        el.projectsContainer.innerHTML = `\n695\t          <div class=\"px-3 py-6 text-center text-xs text-txt-subtle border border-dashed border-dark-border rounded-xl my-2\">\n696\t            No projects yet — add one to get started\n697\t          </div>\n698\t        `;\n699\t        return;\n700\t      }\n701\t\n702\t      el.projectsContainer.innerHTML = state.projects.map(project => {\n703\t        const isExpanded = state.expandedProjects.has(project.id);\n704\t        const isActive = state.activeProjectId === project.id;\n705\t        const isLoading = state.loadingProjects.has(project.id);\n706\t        const sessions = state.projectSessions[project.id] || [];\n707\t\n708\t        let sessionsHtml = '';\n709\t        if (isExpanded) {\n710\t          if (isLoading) {\n711\t            sessionsHtml = `\n712\t              <div class=\"py-2.5 px-4 text-center text-[10px] text-txt-subtle font-mono flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\">\n713\t                <svg class=\"w-3 h-3 animate-spin text-brand\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n714\t                  <circle class=\"opacity-25\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"4\"></circle>\n715\t                  <path class=\"opacity-75\" fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z\"></path>\n716\t                </svg>\n717\t                <span>Loading conversations...</span>\n718\t              </div>\n719\t            `;\n720\t          } else if (sessions.length === 0) {\n721\t            sessionsHtml = `\n722\t              <div class=\"py-2 px-5 text-[10px] text-txt-subtle italic flex items-center justify-between\">\n723\t                <span>No conversations yet</span>\n724\t                <button class=\"project-new-chat-btn text-[10px] text-brand hover:text-brand-hover font-medium underline cursor-pointer\" data-project-id=\"${project.id}\">Start chat</button>\n725\t              </div>\n726\t            `;\n727\t          } else {\n728\t            sessionsHtml = `\n729\t              <div class=\"pl-3 pr-1 py-1 space-y-0.5 border-l border-dark-border/40 ml-3.5 my-1\">\n730\t                ${sessions.map(s => {\n731\t                  const isCurrentSession = s.thread_id === state.currentThreadId;\n732\t                  const rawTitle = s.first_message && s.first_message !== s.thread_id ? s.first_message : 'New conversation';\n733\t                  const truncatedTitle = rawTitle.length > 40 ? rawTitle.slice(0, 40) + '...' : rawTitle;\n734\t                  return `\n735\t                    <div class=\"session-item group px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-all duration-150 flex items-center justify-between ${isCurrentSession ? 'bg-dark-elevated border border-brand/40 text-white font-medium shadow-sm' : 'hover:bg-dark-elevated/50 text-txt-muted hover:text-white border border-transparent'}\" data-thread-id=\"${s.thread_id}\" data-project-id=\"${project.id}\">\n736\t                      <span class=\"text-[11px] truncate flex-1 leading-snug\">${escapeHtml(truncatedTitle)}</span>\n737\t                      <button class=\"delete-session-btn opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 p-0.5 hover:text-red-400 text-txt-subtle transition-opacity ml-1 shrink-0\" data-thread-id=\"${s.thread_id}\" data-project-id=\"${project.id}\" title=\"Delete session\">\n738\t                        <svg class=\"w-3 h-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n739\t                          <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\"/>\n740\t                        </svg>\n741\t                      </button>\n742\t                    </div>\n743\t                  `;\n744\t                }).join('')}\n745\t              </div>\n746\t            `;\n747\t          }\n748\t        }\n749\t\n750\t        return `\n751\t          <div class=\"project-card rounded-xl border transition-all ${isActive ? 'bg-dark-surface/60 border-dark-border' : 'border-transparent hover:border-dark-border/40'}\" data-project-id=\"${project.id}\">\n752\t            <div class=\"project-header group px-2.5 py-2 rounded-xl cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-dark-elevated/40 transition-colors\" data-project-id=\"${project.id}\">\n753\t              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\">\n754\t                <svg class=\"project-chevron w-3.5 h-3.5 text-txt-subtle transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0 ${isExpanded ? 'rotate-90 text-brand' : ''}\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n755\t                  <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\"/>\n756\t                </svg>\n757\t                <span class=\"font-medium text-xs text-white truncate\" title=\"${escapeHtml(project.path)}\">${escapeHtml(project.name)}</span>\n758\t              </div>\n759\t              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-0.5 shrink-0\">\n760\t                <button class=\"project-new-chat-btn opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 p-1 hover:text-brand text-txt-subtle transition-opacity\" data-project-id=\"${project.id}\" title=\"New conversation in ${escapeHtml(project.name)}\">\n761\t                  <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n762\t                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 4v16m8-8H4\"/>\n763\t                  </svg>\n764\t                </button>\n765\t                <button class=\"delete-project-btn opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 p-1 hover:text-red-400 text-txt-subtle transition-opacity\" data-project-id=\"${project.id}\" title=\"Remove project from tracking\">\n766\t                  <svg class=\"w-3 h-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n767\t                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16\"/>\n768\t                  </svg>\n769\t                </button>\n770\t              </div>\n771\t            </div>\n772\t            ${sessionsHtml}\n773\t          </div>\n774\t        `;\n775\t      }).join('');\n776\t\n777\t      // Project expand/collapse click\n778\t      el.projectsContainer.querySelectorAll('.project-header').forEach(header => {\n779\t        header.addEventListener('click', async (e) => {\n780\t          if (e.target.closest('.delete-project-btn') || e.target.closest('.project-new-chat-btn')) return;\n781\t          const projectId = parseInt(header.dataset.projectId, 10);\n782\t          await toggleProject(projectId);\n783\t        });\n784\t      });\n785\t\n786\t      // Per-project New Chat button click\n787\t      el.projectsContainer.querySelectorAll('.project-new-chat-btn').forEach(btn => {\n788\t        btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n789\t          e.stopPropagation();\n790\t          const projectId = parseInt(btn.dataset.projectId, 10);\n791\t          const proj = state.projects.find(p => p.id === projectId);\n792\t          if (proj) {\n793\t            state.activeProjectId = proj.id;\n794\t            localStorage.setItem('qa-active-project-id', proj.id);\n795\t            state.expandedProjects.add(proj.id);\n796\t          }\n797\t          startNewChat();\n798\t        });\n799\t      });\n800\t\n801\t      // Project delete click\n802\t      el.projectsContainer.querySelectorAll('.delete-project-btn').forEach(btn => {\n803\t        btn.addEventListener('click', async (e) => {\n804\t          e.stopPropagation();\n805\t          const projectId = parseInt(btn.dataset.projectId, 10);\n806\t          if (confirm('Remove this project from sidebar tracking? (Files and conversations will be preserved)')) {\n807\t            await deleteProject(projectId);\n808\t          }\n809\t        });\n810\t      });\n811\t\n812\t      // Session click\n813\t      el.projectsContainer.querySelectorAll('.session-item').forEach(item => {\n814\t        item.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n815\t          if (e.target.closest('.delete-session-btn')) return;\n816\t          const threadId = item.dataset.threadId;\n817\t          const projectId = parseInt(item.dataset.projectId, 10);\n818\t          const proj = state.projects.find(p => p.id === projectId);\n819\t          if (proj) {\n820\t            state.activeProjectId = proj.id;\n821\t            localStorage.setItem('qa-active-project-id', proj.id);\n822\t          }\n823\t          selectSession(threadId);\n824\t        });\n825\t      });\n826\t\n827\t      // Session delete click\n828\t      el.projectsContainer.querySelectorAll('.delete-session-btn').forEach(btn => {\n829\t        btn.addEventListener('click', async (e) => {\n830\t          e.stopPropagation();\n831\t          const threadId = btn.dataset.threadId;\n832\t          const projectId = parseInt(btn.dataset.projectId, 10);\n833\t          await deleteSession(threadId, projectId);\n834\t        });\n835\t      });\n836\t    }\n837\t\n838\t    function renderMessageNode(msg) {\n839\t      const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n840\t      wrapper.className = 'animate-msg w-full max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl mx-auto min-w-0';\n841\t\n842\t      if (msg.type === 'human') {\n843\t        wrapper.innerHTML = `\n844\t          <div class=\"flex justify-end mb-2.5 min-w-0 max-w-full\">\n845\t            <div class=\"bg-dark-elevated/90 text-txt-main text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 max-w-[80%] w-fit break-words whitespace-pre-wrap\">${escapeHtml(msg.content)}</div>\n846\t          </div>\n847\t        `;\n848\t      } else if (msg.type === 'ai') {\n849\t        const parsedContent = marked.parse(msg.content || '');\n850\t        const usageBadge = msg.usage ? `\n851\t          <div class=\"mt-2 pt-1.5 border-t border-dark-border/40 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[10px] text-txt-subtle flex-wrap\">\n852\t            <span title=\"Input tokens\">in: <strong class=\"text-txt-muted\">${msg.usage.input_tokens || 0}</strong></span>\n853\t            <span title=\"Output tokens\">out: <strong class=\"text-txt-muted\">${msg.usage.output_tokens || 0}</strong></span>\n854\t            <span title=\"Total tokens\">total: <strong class=\"text-brand\">${msg.usage.total_tokens || 0}</strong></span>\n855\t          </div>\n856\t        ` : '';\n857\t\n858\t        wrapper.innerHTML = `\n859\t          <div class=\"mb-4 w-full min-w-0 max-w-full\">\n860\t            <div class=\"prose-dark ai-content-body min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden break-words px-1 py-1\">\n861\t              ${parsedContent}\n862\t            </div>\n863\t            <div class=\"ai-speech-container\"></div>\n864\t            ${usageBadge}\n865\t          </div>\n866\t        `;\n867\t\n868\t        if (msg.speech_explanation) {\n869\t          const speechContainer = wrapper.querySelector('.ai-speech-container');\n870\t          if (speechContainer) {\n871\t            speechContainer.appendChild(createSpeechPlayerElement(msg.speech_explanation));\n872\t          }\n873\t        }\n874\t      } else if (msg.type === 'thinking') {\n875\t        wrapper.innerHTML = `\n876\t          <div class=\"mb-3 w-full min-w-0 max-w-full\">\n877\t            <div class=\"bg-dark-surface/40 border border-dark-border/60 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-mono min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden\">\n878\t              <details class=\"group\">\n879\t                <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer text-txt-subtle hover:text-txt-muted select-none\">\n880\t                  <span class=\"text-[11px] font-sans font-medium text-txt-subtle\">Thought Process</span>\n881\t                  <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 text-txt-subtle shrink-0 ml-1.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n882\t                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/>\n883\t                  </svg>\n884\t                </summary>\n885\t                <div class=\"mt-2 pt-2 border-t border-dark-border/40 text-txt-muted whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed text-[11px] break-words overflow-x-auto\">${escapeHtml(msg.content)}</div>\n886\t              </details>\n887\t            </div>\n888\t          </div>\n889\t        `;\n890\t      } else if (msg.type === 'tool' || msg.type === 'tool_result') {\n891\t        renderToolCallNode(msg);\n892\t        return;\n893\t      }\n894\t\n895\t      el.messagesContainer.appendChild(wrapper);\n896\t      scrollToBottom();\n897\t    }\n898\t\n899\t    function renderToolCallNode(tool) {\n900\t      const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n901\t      wrapper.className = 'animate-msg w-full max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl mx-auto min-w-0 my-2';\n902\t\n903\t      const toolName = tool.name || tool.tool_name || 'Tool';\n904\t      const inputCmd = tool.input?.command ? `$ ${tool.input.command}` : '';\n905\t      const inputDesc = tool.input?.description || inputCmd || '';\n906\t      const inputObj = tool.input || null;\n907\t      const rawOutput = tool.content ?? tool.output ?? tool.result ?? '';\n908\t      const outputText = typeof rawOutput === 'string' ? rawOutput : JSON.stringify(rawOutput, null, 2);\n909\t\n910\t      wrapper.innerHTML = `\n911\t        <div class=\"bg-dark-surface/90 hover:bg-dark-surface border border-dark-border/80 hover:border-brand/40 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm transition-all min-w-0 max-w-full\">\n912\t          <details class=\"group\">\n913\t            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3.5 py-2.5 cursor-pointer select-none bg-dark-elevated/40 hover:bg-dark-elevated/80 transition-colors min-w-0\">\n914\t              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden pr-2\">\n915\t                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0\">\n916\t                  <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\"></span>\n917\t                  <span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-txt-main px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-dark-elevated border border-dark-border\">${escapeHtml(toolName)}</span>\n918\t                </div>\n919\t                <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-txt-muted truncate block min-w-0 flex-1\">\n920\t                  ${inputCmd ? escapeHtml(inputCmd) : (inputDesc ? escapeHtml(inputDesc) : 'Executed tool')}\n921\t                </span>\n922\t              </div>\n923\t              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0 ml-1\">\n924\t                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-txt-subtle group-open:hidden hidden sm:inline\">View output</span>\n925\t                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 text-txt-subtle shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n926\t                  <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/>\n927\t                </svg>\n928\t              </div>\n929\t            </summary>\n930\t            <div class=\"border-t border-dark-border/60 bg-[#0a0b0e] p-3 text-xs font-mono space-y-2.5 overflow-hidden\">\n931\t              ${inputObj && Object.keys(inputObj).length > 0 ? `\n932\t                <div class=\"min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden\">\n933\t                  <div class=\"text-[10px] text-txt-subtle uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 font-mono\">Input Parameters</div>\n934\t                  <pre class=\"text-[11px] text-emerald-400/90 overflow-x-auto bg-dark-surface/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-dark-border/60 leading-relaxed max-h-40 max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-all\">${escapeHtml(formatJson(inputObj))}</pre>\n935\t                </div>\n936\t              ` : ''}\n937\t              ${outputText ? `\n938\t                <div class=\"min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden\">\n939\t                  <div class=\"text-[10px] text-txt-subtle uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 font-mono\">Output</div>\n940\t                  <pre class=\"text-[11px] text-txt-muted overflow-x-auto bg-dark-surface/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-dark-border/60 leading-relaxed max-h-56 max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-all\">${escapeHtml(outputText)}</pre>\n941\t                </div>\n942\t              ` : ''}\n943\t            </div>\n944\t          </details>\n945\t        </div>\n946\t      `;\n947\t\n948\t      el.messagesContainer.appendChild(wrapper);\n949\t      scrollToBottom();\n950\t    }\n951\t\n952\t    function clearToolCalls() {}\n953\t\n954\t    // ============== Speech Explanation TTS Player ==============\n955\t    let currentSpeechId = 0;\n956\t\n957\t    const speechAudioPlayer = {\n958\t      isPlaying: false,\n959\t      activeMessageEl: null,\n960\t      rate: 1.0,\n961\t    };\n962\t\n963\t    function stopSpeechAudio() {\n964\t      currentSpeechId++;\n965\t      if ('speechSynthesis' in window) {\n966\t        window.speechSynthesis.cancel();\n967\t      }\n968\t      speechAudioPlayer.isPlaying = false;\n969\t      speechAudioPlayer.activeMessageEl = null;\n970\t\n971\t      document.querySelectorAll('.speech-play-btn').forEach(btn => {\n972\t        btn.className = 'speech-play-btn flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white text-xs font-medium transition-colors shadow-sm shrink-0';\n973\t        btn.innerHTML = `<svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg><span class=\"speech-btn-label\">Listen Explanation</span>`;\n974\t      });\n975\t      document.querySelectorAll('.speech-status').forEach(s => s.textContent = '');\n976\t    }\n977\t\n978\t    function playSpeechExplanation(text, container) {\n979\t      if (!('speechSynthesis' in window) || !text) return;\n980\t\n981\t      const playBtn = container.querySelector('.speech-play-btn');\n982\t      const statusText = container.querySelector('.speech-status');\n983\t\n984\t      if (speechAudioPlayer.isPlaying && speechAudioPlayer.activeMessageEl === container) {\n985\t        stopSpeechAudio();\n986\t        return;\n987\t      }\n988\t\n989\t      stopSpeechAudio();\n990\t      currentSpeechId++;\n991\t      const speechId = currentSpeechId;\n992\t\n993\t      speechAudioPlayer.isPlaying = true;\n994\t      speechAudioPlayer.activeMessageEl = container;\n995\t\n996\t      if (playBtn) {\n997\t        playBtn.className = 'speech-play-btn flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-brand text-white text-xs font-medium transition-colors shadow-glow shrink-0';\n998\t        playBtn.innerHTML = `<span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white animate-pulse\"></span><span>Playing</span>`;\n999\t      }\n1000\t      if (statusText) statusText.textContent = 'Audio playing...';\n1001\t\n1002\t      const utterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text);\n1003\t      utterance.rate = speechAudioPlayer.rate;\n1004\t\n1005\t      utterance.onend = () => {\n1006\t        if (speechId !== currentSpeechId) return;\n1007\t        stopSpeechAudio();\n1008\t      };\n1009\t\n1010\t      utterance.onerror = (e) => {\n1011\t        if (speechId !== currentSpeechId) return;\n1012\t        if (e.error === 'canceled' || e.error === 'interrupted') return;\n1013\t        stopSpeechAudio();\n1014\t      };\n1015\t\n1016\t      window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);\n1017\t    }\n1018\t\n1019\t    function createSpeechPlayerElement(speechText) {\n1020\t      const container = document.createElement('div');\n1021\t      container.className = 'mt-2.5 max-w-lg';\n1022\t      container.innerHTML = `\n1023\t        <div class=\"speech-player-widget p-2 rounded-xl bg-dark-elevated/60 border border-dark-border/60 flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n1024\t          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0\">\n1025\t            <button type=\"button\" class=\"speech-play-btn flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white text-xs font-medium transition-colors shadow-sm shrink-0\">\n1026\t              <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg>\n1027\t              <span class=\"speech-btn-label\">Listen Explanation</span>\n1028\t            </button>\n1029\t            <span class=\"speech-status text-[11px] text-txt-subtle font-mono truncate\"></span>\n1030\t          </div>\n1031\t          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0\">\n1032\t            <button type=\"button\" class=\"speech-speed-btn px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-dark-surface text-txt-subtle hover:text-white font-mono text-[10px] transition-colors\" title=\"Playback speed\">${speechAudioPlayer.rate}x</button>\n1033\t            <button type=\"button\" class=\"speech-script-toggle text-[11px] text-txt-subtle hover:text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-dark-surface transition-colors\" title=\"Toggle transcript\">Script</button>\n1034\t          </div>\n1035\t        </div>\n1036\t        <div class=\"speech-script-view hidden mt-1.5 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-dark-bg/60 border border-dark-border/40 text-xs text-txt-muted leading-relaxed font-sans\">\n1037\t          ${escapeHtml(speechText)}\n1038\t        </div>\n1039\t      `;\n1040\t\n1041\t      const playBtn = container.querySelector('.speech-play-btn');\n1042\t      const speedBtn = container.querySelector('.speech-speed-btn');\n1043\t      const scriptToggle = container.querySelector('.speech-script-toggle');\n1044\t      const scriptView = container.querySelector('.speech-script-view');\n1045\t\n1046\t      playBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1047\t        playSpeechExplanation(speechText, container);\n1048\t      });\n1049\t\n1050\t      speedBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1051\t        const speeds = [1.0, 1.25, 1.5, 2.0];\n1052\t        const nextSpeed = speeds[(speeds.indexOf(speechAudioPlayer.rate) + 1) % speeds.length];\n1053\t        speechAudioPlayer.rate = nextSpeed;\n1054\t        document.querySelectorAll('.speech-speed-btn').forEach(b => b.textContent = `${nextSpeed}x`);\n1055\t        if (speechAudioPlayer.isPlaying && speechAudioPlayer.activeMessageEl === container) {\n1056\t          playSpeechExplanation(speechText, container);\n1057\t        }\n1058\t      });\n1059\t\n1060\t      scriptToggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1061\t        scriptView?.classList.toggle('hidden');\n1062\t      });\n1063\t\n1064\t      return container;\n1065\t    }\n1066\t\n1067\t    // Persistent Loading Bar State Control\n1068\t    let activeLoadingNode = null;\n1069\t\n1070\t    function showLoadingIndicator() {\n1071\t      if (activeLoadingNode) return;\n1072\t\n1073\t      activeLoadingNode = document.createElement('div');\n1074\t      activeLoadingNode.id = 'active-loader';\n1075\t      activeLoadingNode.className = 'animate-msg flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 w-full max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl mx-auto';\n1076\t      activeLoadingNode.innerHTML = `\n1077\t        <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-brand/20 border border-brand-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-brand\">\n1078\t          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 animate-spin\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n1079\t            <circle class=\"opacity-25\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"4\"></circle>\n1080\t            <path class=\"opacity-75\" fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z\"></path>\n1081\t          </svg>\n1082\t        </div>\n1083\t        <div class=\"bg-dark-surface border border-dark-border rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-2\">\n1084\t          <span class=\"flex gap-1 items-center\">\n1085\t            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand pulse-dot\"></span>\n1086\t            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand pulse-dot\"></span>\n1087\t            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand pulse-dot\"></span>\n1088\t          </span>\n1089\t          <span class=\"text-xs text-txt-muted font-medium\">Agent is processing...</span>\n1090\t        </div>\n1091\t      `;\n1092\t      el.messagesContainer.appendChild(activeLoadingNode);\n1093\t      scrollToBottom();\n1094\t    }\n1095\t\n1096\t    function hideLoadingIndicator() {\n1097\t      if (activeLoadingNode) {\n1098\t        activeLoadingNode.remove();\n1099\t        activeLoadingNode = null;\n1100\t      }\n1101\t    }\n1102\t\n1103\t    function showError(message) {\n1104\t      hideLoadingIndicator();\n1105\t      const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n1106\t      wrapper.className = 'animate-msg flex justify-start mb-4 w-full max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl mx-auto';\n1107\t      wrapper.innerHTML = `\n1108\t        <div class=\"bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/30 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 max-w-[85%] text-xs text-red-400\">\n1109\t          <span class=\"font-semibold block mb-1\">Execution Error</span>\n1110\t          ${escapeHtml(message)}\n1111\t        </div>\n1112\t      `;\n1113\t      el.messagesContainer.appendChild(wrapper);\n1114\t      scrollToBottom();\n1115\t    }\n1116\t\n1117\t    // ============== Utilities ==============\n1118\t    function escapeHtml(str) {\n1119\t      if (!str) return '';\n1120\t      return String(str)\n1121\t        .replace(/&/g, '&amp;')\n1122\t        .replace(/</g, '&lt;')\n1123\t        .replace(/>/g, '&gt;')\n1124\t        .replace(/\"/g, '&quot;')\n1125\t        .replace(/'/g, '&#039;');\n1126\t    }\n1127\t\n1128\t    function formatJson(val) {\n1129\t      if (typeof val === 'object') return JSON.stringify(val, null, 2);\n1130\t      try {\n1131\t        return JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(val), null, 2);\n1132\t      } catch {\n1133\t        return String(val);\n1134\t      }\n1135\t    }\n1136\t\n1137\t    let _scrollRafPending = false;\n1138\t    function scrollToBottom() {\n1139\t      if (_scrollRafPending) return;\n1140\t      _scrollRafPending = true;\n1141\t      requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n1142\t        el.messagesContainer.scrollTop = el.messagesContainer.scrollHeight;\n1143\t        _scrollRafPending = false;\n1144\t      });\n1145\t    }\n1146\t\n1147\t    function updateSessionTokensWidget() {\n1148\t      // Legacy — tokens now shown via context bar\n1149\t    }\n1150\t\n1151\t    function renderCurrentSessionView(threadId = state.currentThreadId) {\n1152\t      if (!threadId) return;\n1153\t      stopSpeechAudio();\n1154\t      el.messagesContainer.innerHTML = '';\n1155\t      clearToolCalls();\n1156\t\n1157\t      const messages = state.messages[threadId] || [];\n1158\t      const cleanMessages = messages.filter(m => {\n1159\t        if (typeof m.content !== 'string') return true;\n1160\t        if (m.content.startsWith('Stop hook feedback:')) return false;\n1161\t        if (m.content.startsWith('[structured-output-enforce]')) return false;\n1162\t        if (m.content.includes('You MUST call the StructuredOutput tool')) return false;\n1163\t        return true;\n1164\t      });\n1165\t      const regularMessages = cleanMessages.filter(m => m.type !== 'tool_result');\n1166\t\n1167\t      if (regularMessages.length === 0) {\n1168\t        el.emptyState.style.display = 'flex';\n1169\t        el.messagesContainer.appendChild(el.emptyState);\n1170\t        return;\n1171\t      }\n1172\t\n1173\t      el.emptyState.style.display = 'none';\n1174\t      for (const msg of cleanMessages) {\n1175\t        renderMessageNode(msg);\n1176\t      }\n1177\t    }\n1178\t\n1179\t    async function selectSession(threadId) {\n1180\t      if (window.innerWidth < 1024) {\n1181\t        el.sidebar?.classList.add('-translate-x-full');\n1182\t        el.sidebarBackdrop?.classList.add('hidden');\n1183\t      }\n1184\t      stopSpeechAudio();\n1185\t      setCurrentThread(threadId);\n1186\t      renderProjects();\n1187\t      state.contextUsage = null;\n1188\t      updateContextBar(null);\n1189\t\n1190\t      el.messagesContainer.innerHTML = '';\n1191\t      showLoadingIndicator();\n1192\t\n1193\t      try {\n1194\t        const projectParam = state.activeProjectId ? `&project_id=${state.activeProjectId}` : '';\n1195\t        const res = await fetch(`/api/sessions/${threadId}/messages?limit=50${projectParam}`);\n1196\t        hideLoadingIndicator();\n1197\t\n1198\t        if (res.ok) {\n1199\t          const data = await res.json();\n1200\t          state.messages[threadId] = data.messages || [];\n1201\t          state.sessionCursors[threadId] = data.next_cursor !== undefined ? data.next_cursor : null;\n1202\t\n1203\t          renderCurrentSessionView(threadId);\n1204\t          scrollToBottom();\n1205\t        }\n1206\t      } catch (e) {\n1207\t        hideLoadingIndicator();\n1208\t        showError('Failed to load session messages from server.');\n1209\t      }\n1210\t      updateSessionTokensWidget();\n1211\t    }\n1212\t\n1213\t    async function loadOlderMessages(threadId = state.currentThreadId) {\n1214\t      if (!threadId || state.isLoadingOlder[threadId] || !state.sessionCursors[threadId]) return;\n1215\t\n1216\t      const cursor = state.sessionCursors[threadId];\n1217\t      state.isLoadingOlder[threadId] = true;\n1218\t\n1219\t      // Show top loading indicator\n1220\t      let topLoader = document.getElementById('loading-older-messages');\n1221\t      if (!topLoader) {\n1222\t        topLoader = document.createElement('div');\n1223\t        topLoader.id = 'loading-older-messages';\n1224\t        topLoader.className = 'w-full flex items-center justify-center py-2 text-txt-subtle text-xs gap-2 shrink-0';\n1225\t        topLoader.innerHTML = `\n1226\t          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-spin text-brand\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n1227\t            <circle class=\"opacity-25\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"4\"></circle>\n1228\t            <path class=\"opacity-75\" fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z\"></path>\n1229\t          </svg>\n1230\t          <span>Loading older messages...</span>\n1231\t        `;\n1232\t        el.messagesContainer.prepend(topLoader);\n1233\t      }\n1234\t\n1235\t      try {\n1236\t        const projectParam = state.activeProjectId ? `&project_id=${state.activeProjectId}` : '';\n1237\t        const res = await fetch(`/api/sessions/${threadId}/messages?limit=50&cursor=${cursor}${projectParam}`);\n1238\t\n1239\t        if (res.ok) {\n1240\t          const data = await res.json();\n1241\t          const newMessages = data.messages || [];\n1242\t          state.sessionCursors[threadId] = data.next_cursor !== undefined ? data.next_cursor : null;\n1243\t\n1244\t          if (newMessages.length > 0) {\n1245\t            const prevScrollHeight = el.messagesContainer.scrollHeight;\n1246\t            const prevScrollTop = el.messagesContainer.scrollTop;\n1247\t\n1248\t            state.messages[threadId] = [...newMessages, ...(state.messages[threadId] || [])];\n1249\t\n1250\t            renderCurrentSessionView(threadId);\n1251\t\n1252\t            // Restore scroll position smoothly\n1253\t            requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n1254\t              el.messagesContainer.scrollTop = el.messagesContainer.scrollHeight - prevScrollHeight + prevScrollTop;\n1255\t            });\n1256\t          }\n1257\t        }\n1258\t      } catch (e) {\n1259\t        console.error('Failed to load older messages:', e);\n1260\t      } finally {\n1261\t        state.isLoadingOlder[threadId] = false;\n1262\t        document.getElementById('loading-older-messages')?.remove();\n1263\t      }\n1264\t    }\n1265\t\n1266\t    function startNewChat() {\n1267\t      if (window.innerWidth < 1024) {\n1268\t        el.sidebar?.classList.add('-translate-x-full');\n1269\t        el.sidebarBackdrop?.classList.add('hidden');\n1270\t      }\n1271\t      stopSpeechAudio();\n1272\t      // Abort any in-progress stream\n1273\t      if (state.abortController) {\n1274\t        state.abortController.abort();\n1275\t        state.abortController = null;\n1276\t        state.isStreaming = false;\n1277\t      }\n1278\t      clearToolCalls();\n1279\t      state.contextUsage = null;\n1280\t      updateContextBar(null);\n1281\t      setCurrentThread(null);\n1282\t      renderProjects();\n1283\t      el.messagesContainer.innerHTML = '';\n1284\t      el.messagesContainer.appendChild(el.emptyState);\n1285\t      el.emptyState.style.display = 'flex';\n1286\t      updateSessionTokensWidget();\n1287\t      el.messageInput.focus();\n1288\t    }\n1289\t\n1290\t    async function deleteSession(threadId, projectId) {\n1291\t      stopSpeechAudio();\n1292\t      try {\n1293\t        await fetch(`/api/sessions/${threadId}`, { method: 'DELETE' });\n1294\t      } catch (e) {}\n1295\t\n1296\t      if (projectId && state.projectSessions[projectId]) {\n1297\t        state.projectSessions[projectId] = state.projectSessions[projectId].filter(s => s.thread_id !== threadId);\n1298\t      }\n1299\t      delete state.messages[threadId];\n1300\t\n1301\t      if (state.currentThreadId === threadId) {\n1302\t        startNewChat();\n1303\t      } else {\n1304\t        renderProjects();\n1305\t      }\n1306\t    }\n1307\t\n1308\t    async function sendMessage(overrideText = null) {\n1309\t      const text = (overrideText || el.messageInput.value).trim();\n1310\t      if (!text || state.isStreaming) return;\n1311\t\n1312\t      el.messageInput.value = '';\n1313\t      el.messageInput.style.height = 'auto';\n1314\t      el.sendBtn.disabled = true;\n1315\t      state.isStreaming = true;\n1316\t\n1317\t      // Hide empty screen\n1318\t      el.emptyState.style.display = 'none';\n1319\t\n1320\t      // Ensure thread ID\n1321\t      const isNewSession = !state.currentThreadId;\n1322\t      if (!state.currentThreadId) {\n1323\t        state.currentThreadId = `session-${Date.now().toString(36)}`;\n1324\t      }\n1325\t\n1326\t      // Add user message node\n1327\t      const userMsg = { type: 'human', content: text };\n1328\t      renderMessageNode(userMsg);\n1329\t      if (!state.messages[state.currentThreadId]) {\n1330\t        state.messages[state.currentThreadId] = [];\n1331\t      }\n1332\t      state.messages[state.currentThreadId].push(userMsg);\n1333\t\n1334\t      // Show loader\n1335\t      showLoadingIndicator();\n1336\t\n1337\t      // Create AbortController for cancellation support\n1338\t      state.abortController = new AbortController();\n1339\t\n1340\t      try {\n1341\t        let activeAiWrapper = null;\n1342\t        let activeAiTextEl = null;\n1343\t        let activeThinkingTextEl = null;\n1344\t\n1345\t        for await (const { event, data } of streamChat(text, state.currentThreadId, state.abortController.signal)) {\n1346\t          if (event === 'message') {\n1347\t            if (data.type === 'human') continue;\n1348\t            if (data.type === 'context_usage') {\n1349\t              state.contextUsage = data.data;\n1350\t              updateContextBar(data.data);\n1351\t              continue;\n1352\t            }\n1353\t\n1354\t            if (data.type === 'speech_explanation') {\n1355\t              if (activeAiWrapper && data.content) {\n1356\t                activeAiWrapper._speechExplanation = data.content;\n1357\t                const speechContainer = activeAiWrapper.querySelector('.ai-speech-container');\n1358\t                if (speechContainer) {\n1359\t                  speechContainer.innerHTML = '';\n1360\t                  speechContainer.appendChild(createSpeechPlayerElement(data.content));\n1361\t                  scrollToBottom();\n1362\t                }\n1363\t              }\n1364\t              continue;\n1365\t            }\n1366\t\n1367\t            hideLoadingIndicator();\n1368\t\n1369\t            if (data.type === 'text_delta') {\n1370\t              if (!activeAiWrapper) {\n1371\t                activeAiWrapper = document.createElement('div');\n1372\t                activeAiWrapper.className = 'animate-msg w-full max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-4 min-w-0';\n1373\t                activeAiWrapper.innerHTML = `\n1374\t                  <div class=\"mb-4 w-full min-w-0 max-w-full\">\n1375\t                    <div class=\"prose-dark ai-content-body min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden break-words px-1 py-1\"></div>\n1376\t                    <div class=\"ai-speech-container\"></div>\n1377\t                  </div>\n1378\t                `;\n1379\t                activeAiTextEl = activeAiWrapper.querySelector('.ai-content-body');\n1380\t                activeAiTextEl.dataset.raw = '';\n1381\t                el.messagesContainer.appendChild(activeAiWrapper);\n1382\t              }\n1383\t\n1384\t              activeAiTextEl.dataset.raw += data.content;\n1385\t              // Debounce markdown re-rendering with requestAnimationFrame\n1386\t              if (!activeAiTextEl._rafPending) {\n1387\t                activeAiTextEl._rafPending = true;\n1388\t                requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n1389\t                  activeAiTextEl.innerHTML = marked.parse(activeAiTextEl.dataset.raw);\n1390\t                  activeAiTextEl._rafPending = false;\n1391\t                  scrollToBottom();\n1392\t                });\n1393\t              }\n1394\t            }\n1395\t            else if (data.type === 'thinking_delta') {\n1396\t              if (!activeThinkingTextEl) {\n1397\t                const thinkWrapper = document.createElement('div');\n1398\t                thinkWrapper.className = 'animate-msg w-full max-w-3xl lg:max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-3 min-w-0';\n1399\t                thinkWrapper.innerHTML = `\n1400\t                  <div class=\"bg-dark-surface/40 border border-dark-border/60 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-mono min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden\">\n1401\t                    <details class=\"group\" open>\n1402\t                      <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer text-txt-subtle hover:text-txt-muted select-none\">\n1403\t                        <span class=\"text-[11px] font-sans font-medium text-txt-subtle\">Thought Process</span>\n1404\t                        <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 text-txt-subtle shrink-0 ml-1.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n1405\t                          <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/>\n1406\t                        </svg>\n1407\t                      </summary>\n1408\t                      <div class=\"thinking-body mt-2 pt-2 border-t border-dark-border/40 text-txt-muted whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed text-[11px] break-words overflow-x-auto\"></div>\n1409\t                    </details>\n1410\t                  </div>\n1411\t                `;\n1412\t                activeThinkingTextEl = thinkWrapper.querySelector('.thinking-body');\n1413\t                el.messagesContainer.appendChild(thinkWrapper);\n1414\t              }\n1415\t              activeThinkingTextEl.textContent += data.content;\n1416\t              scrollToBottom();\n1417\t            }\n1418\t            else if (data.type === 'tool_result') {\n1419\t              activeAiWrapper = null;\n1420\t              activeAiTextEl = null;\n1421\t              activeThinkingTextEl = null;\n1422\t              if (!state.messages[state.currentThreadId]) {\n1423\t                state.messages[state.currentThreadId] = [];\n1424\t              }\n1425\t              state.messages[state.currentThreadId].push(data);\n1426\t              renderToolCallNode(data);\n1427\t              showLoadingIndicator();\n1428\t            }\n1429\t            else {\n1430\t              activeAiWrapper = null;\n1431\t              activeAiTextEl = null;\n1432\t              activeThinkingTextEl = null;\n1433\t              renderMessageNode(data);\n1434\t              showLoadingIndicator();\n1435\t            }\n1436\t          } else if (event === 'done') {\n1437\t            hideLoadingIndicator();\n1438\t            const threadChanged = data.thread_id && data.thread_id !== state.currentThreadId;\n1439\t            if (threadChanged) {\n1440\t              setCurrentThread(data.thread_id);\n1441\t            }\n1442\t            if (activeAiTextEl && activeAiTextEl.dataset.raw) {\n1443\t              if (data.usage) {\n1444\t                const usageBadge = document.createElement('div');\n1445\t                usageBadge.className = 'mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-dark-border/60 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[10px] text-txt-subtle';\n1446\t                usageBadge.innerHTML = `\n1447\t                  <span title=\"Input tokens\">in: <strong class=\"text-txt-muted\">${data.usage.input_tokens || 0}</strong></span>\n1448\t                  <span title=\"Output tokens\">out: <strong class=\"text-txt-muted\">${data.usage.output_tokens || 0}</strong></span>\n1449\t                  <span title=\"Total tokens\">total: <strong class=\"text-brand\">${data.usage.total_tokens || 0}</strong></span>\n1450\t                `;\n1451\t                activeAiTextEl.appendChild(usageBadge);\n1452\t              }\n1453\t\n1454\t              if (!state.messages[state.currentThreadId]) {\n1455\t                state.messages[state.currentThreadId] = [];\n1456\t              }\n1457\t              state.messages[state.currentThreadId].push({\n1458\t                type: 'ai',\n1459\t                content: activeAiTextEl.dataset.raw,\n1460\t                speech_explanation: activeAiWrapper?._speechExplanation || null,\n1461\t                usage: data.usage || null,\n1462\t              });\n1463\t              updateSessionTokensWidget();\n1464\t            }\n1465\t\n1466\t            if (isNewSession || threadChanged) {\n1467\t              if (state.activeProjectId) {\n1468\t                await loadProjectSessions(state.activeProjectId);\n1469\t                renderProjects();\n1470\t              }\n1471\t            }\n1472\t          } else if (event === 'error') {\n1473\t            showError(data.message || 'Stream processing failed');\n1474\t          }\n1475\t        }\n1476\t      } catch (err) {\n1477\t        if (err.name !== 'AbortError') {\n1478\t          showError(err.message || 'Failed to communicate with agent server');\n1479\t        }\n1480\t      } finally {\n1481\t        hideLoadingIndicator();\n1482\t        state.isStreaming = false;\n1483\t        state.abortController = null;\n1484\t        el.sendBtn.disabled = el.messageInput.value.trim().length === 0;\n1485\t        el.messageInput.focus();\n1486\t      }\n1487\t    }\n1488\t\n1489\t    // ============== Notifications ==============\n1490\t    function showNotification(message, type = 'info') {\n1491\t      const notification = document.createElement('div');\n1492\t      const colors = {\n1493\t        success: 'bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-500/30',\n1494\t        error: 'bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border-red-500/30',\n1495\t        info: 'bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 border-blue-500/30',\n1496\t      };\n1497\t      notification.className = `fixed bottom-4 right-4 z-50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border ${colors[type] || colors.info} shadow-lg animate-msg`;\n1498\t      notification.textContent = message;\n1499\t      document.body.appendChild(notification);\n1500\t      setTimeout(() => {\n1501\t        notification.style.opacity = '0';\n1502\t        notification.style.transition = 'opacity 0.3s';\n1503\t        setTimeout(() => notification.remove(), 300);\n1504\t      }, 3000);\n1505\t    }\n1506\t\n1507\t    // ============== Listeners ==============\n1508\t    el.sendBtn.addEventListener('click', () => sendMessage());\n1509\t\n1510\t    function isMobileView() {\n1511\t      return window.innerWidth < 768 || window.matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches || ('ontouchstart' in window);\n1512\t    }\n1513\t\n1514\t    el.messageInput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n1515\t      if (e.key === 'Enter' && !e.shiftKey) {\n1516\t        // On phone/mobile, Enter inserts a new line; only tapping the Send button sends the message\n1517\t        if (isMobileView()) {\n1518\t          return;\n1519\t        }\n1520\t        e.preventDefault();\n1521\t        sendMessage();\n1522\t      }\n1523\t    });\n1524\t\n1525\t    el.messageInput.addEventListener('input', () => {\n1526\t      // Auto expand textarea height\n1527\t      el.messageInput.style.height = 'auto';\n1528\t      el.messageInput.style.height = Math.min(el.messageInput.scrollHeight, 192) + 'px';\n1529\t\n1530\t      el.sendBtn.disabled = el.messageInput.value.trim().length === 0 || state.isStreaming;\n1531\t    });\n1532\t\n1533\t    el.messagesContainer?.addEventListener('scroll', () => {\n1534\t      if (\n1535\t        el.messagesContainer.scrollTop <= 60 &&\n1536\t        state.currentThreadId &&\n1537\t        state.sessionCursors[state.currentThreadId] &&\n1538\t        !state.isLoadingOlder[state.currentThreadId]\n1539\t      ) {\n1540\t        loadOlderMessages(state.currentThreadId);\n1541\t      }\n1542\t    });\n1543\t\n1544\t    el.expandAllBtn?.addEventListener('click', expandAllProjects);\n1545\t    el.collapseAllBtn?.addEventListener('click', collapseAllProjects);\n1546\t\n1547\t    el.addProjectBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1548\t      el.addProjectForm?.classList.toggle('hidden');\n1549\t      if (!el.addProjectForm?.classList.contains('hidden')) {\n1550\t        el.newProjectPathInput?.focus();\n1551\t      }\n1552\t    });\n1553\t\n1554\t    el.cancelAddProjectBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1555\t      el.addProjectForm?.classList.add('hidden');\n1556\t      if (el.newProjectPathInput) el.newProjectPathInput.value = '';\n1557\t      if (el.newProjectNameInput) el.newProjectNameInput.value = '';\n1558\t    });\n1559\t\n1560\t    const handleAddProjectSubmit = async () => {\n1561\t      const path = el.newProjectPathInput?.value;\n1562\t      const name = el.newProjectNameInput?.value;\n1563\t      const success = await addNewProject(name, path);\n1564\t      if (success) {\n1565\t        el.addProjectForm?.classList.add('hidden');\n1566\t        if (el.newProjectPathInput) el.newProjectPathInput.value = '';\n1567\t        if (el.newProjectNameInput) el.newProjectNameInput.value = '';\n1568\t      }\n1569\t    };\n1570\t\n1571\t    el.submitAddProjectBtn?.addEventListener('click', handleAddProjectSubmit);\n1572\t    el.newProjectPathInput?.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n1573\t      if (e.key === 'Enter') handleAddProjectSubmit();\n1574\t    });\n1575\t    el.newProjectNameInput?.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n1576\t      if (e.key === 'Enter') handleAddProjectSubmit();\n1577\t    });\n1578\t\n1579\t    el.settingsBtn?.addEventListener('click', showSettingsModal);\n1580\t\n1581\t    // ============== Settings Modal ==============\n1582\t    function showSettingsModal() {\n1583\t      const existing = document.getElementById('settings-modal');\n1584\t      if (existing) existing.remove();\n1585\t\n1586\t      const modal = document.createElement('div');\n1587\t      modal.id = 'settings-modal';\n1588\t      modal.className = 'fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm animate-msg p-4';\n1589\t      \n1590\t      const currentSources = state.settingSources ? (state.settingSources.includes('user') ? 'user' : (state.settingSources.includes('local') ? 'local' : 'default')) : 'default';\n1591\t      const currentPerm = state.permissionMode || 'default';\n1592\t      const currentSkillsMode = state.skillsMode || 'default';\n1593\t\n1594\t      modal.innerHTML = `\n1595\t        <div class=\"bg-dark-surface border border-dark-border rounded-2xl p-5 w-full max-w-lg shadow-2xl space-y-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto\">\n1596\t          <!-- Header -->\n1597\t          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-dark-border/60\">\n1598\t            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n1599\t              <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-brand\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n1600\t                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" d=\"M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z\"/>\n1601\t                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" d=\"M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n1602\t              </svg>\n1603\t              <h3 class=\"font-medium text-sm text-white\">Agent & Session Settings</h3>\n1604\t            </div>\n1605\t            <button id=\"close-settings-btn\" class=\"text-txt-subtle hover:text-white p-1 rounded-lg hover:bg-dark-elevated transition-colors text-base leading-none\">&times;</button>\n1606\t          </div>\n1607\t\n1608\t          <div class=\"space-y-3.5 py-1\">\n1609\t            \n1610\t            <!-- 1. Permission Mode -->\n1611\t            <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-dark-elevated/40 border border-dark-border/60 space-y-2\">\n1612\t              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n1613\t                <div>\n1614\t                  <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white\">Permission Mode</div>\n1615\t                  <div class=\"text-[11px] text-txt-subtle\">Controls what the agent is allowed to do</div>\n1616\t                </div>\n1617\t              </div>\n1618\t              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 bg-dark-bg/80 p-1 rounded-lg border border-dark-border/60 text-[11px] font-medium\">\n1619\t                <button type=\"button\" class=\"perm-option py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${currentPerm === 'default' ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}\" data-val=\"default\">Default</button>\n1620\t                <button type=\"button\" class=\"perm-option py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${currentPerm === 'plan' ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}\" data-val=\"plan\">Read-Only</button>\n1621\t                <button type=\"button\" class=\"perm-option py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${currentPerm === 'bypassPermissions' ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}\" data-val=\"bypassPermissions\">Full Access</button>\n1622\t              </div>\n1623\t              <div id=\"perm-desc\" class=\"text-[10px] text-txt-subtle font-mono\"></div>\n1624\t            </div>\n1625\t\n1626\t            <!-- 2. Settings Sources -->\n1627\t            <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-dark-elevated/40 border border-dark-border/60 space-y-2\">\n1628\t              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n1629\t                <div>\n1630\t                  <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white\">Settings Sources</div>\n1631\t                  <div class=\"text-[11px] text-txt-subtle\">Choose which Claude config files to load</div>\n1632\t                </div>\n1633\t              </div>\n1634\t              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 bg-dark-bg/80 p-1 rounded-lg border border-dark-border/60 text-[11px] font-medium\">\n1635\t                <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-option py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${currentSources === 'default' ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}\" data-val=\"default\">Default (All)</button>\n1636\t                <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-option py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${currentSources === 'user' ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}\" data-val=\"user\">User (~/.claude)</button>\n1637\t                <button type=\"button\" class=\"source-option py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${currentSources === 'local' ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}\" data-val=\"local\">Local (.claude)</button>\n1638\t              </div>\n1639\t              <div id=\"source-desc\" class=\"text-[10px] text-txt-subtle font-mono\"></div>\n1640\t            </div>\n1641\t\n1642\t            <!-- 3. Skills Configurations -->\n1643\t            <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-dark-elevated/40 border border-dark-border/60 space-y-2.5\">\n1644\t              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n1645\t                <div>\n1646\t                  <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white\">Skills Configuration</div>\n1647\t                  <div class=\"text-[11px] text-txt-subtle\">Controls which skills are available in the session</div>\n1648\t                </div>\n1649\t              </div>\n1650\t              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 bg-dark-bg/80 p-1 rounded-lg border border-dark-border/60 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-medium\">\n1651\t                <button type=\"button\" class=\"skills-mode-btn py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${currentSkillsMode === 'default' ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}\" data-mode=\"default\">Default</button>\n1652\t                <button type=\"button\" class=\"skills-mode-btn py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${currentSkillsMode === 'none' ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}\" data-mode=\"none\">No Skills</button>\n1653\t                <button type=\"button\" class=\"skills-mode-btn py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${currentSkillsMode === 'custom' ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}\" data-mode=\"custom\">Custom</button>\n1654\t              </div>\n1655\t\n1656\t              <!-- Custom Skills Tag Input Container (shown when mode === 'custom') -->\n1657\t              <div id=\"custom-skills-container\" class=\"space-y-2 pt-1 ${currentSkillsMode === 'custom' ? '' : 'hidden'}\">\n1658\t                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n1659\t                  <input id=\"new-skill-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. writing-plans, agent-reach...\" class=\"flex-1 bg-dark-bg border border-dark-border rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-white placeholder-txt-subtle focus:outline-none focus:border-brand/60 font-mono\" />\n1660\t                  <button id=\"add-skill-btn\" type=\"button\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-medium transition-colors\">Add</button>\n1661\t                </div>\n1662\t                <div id=\"skills-tags-list\" class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 max-h-28 overflow-y-auto p-1.5 bg-dark-bg/60 rounded-lg border border-dark-border/40 min-h-[32px]\"></div>\n1663\t              </div>\n1664\t              <div id=\"skills-desc\" class=\"text-[10px] text-txt-subtle font-mono\"></div>\n1665\t            </div>\n1666\t\n1667\t            <!-- 4. Speech Explanation Toggle -->\n1668\t            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-dark-elevated/40 border border-dark-border/60\">\n1669\t              <div class=\"space-y-0.5 pr-4\">\n1670\t                <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white\">Speech Explanation</div>\n1671\t                <div class=\"text-[11px] text-txt-subtle leading-relaxed\">Enable spoken voice explanations for AI responses.</div>\n1672\t              </div>\n1673\t              <button id=\"modal-speech-toggle\" type=\"button\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-5 w-9 shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-full border-2 border-transparent transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out focus:outline-none ${state.speechExplanation ? 'bg-brand' : 'bg-dark-border'}\">\n1674\t                <span class=\"pointer-events-none inline-block h-4 w-4 transform rounded-full bg-white shadow ring-0 transition duration-200 ease-in-out ${state.speechExplanation ? 'translate-x-4' : 'translate-x-0'}\"></span>\n1675\t              </button>\n1676\t            </div>\n1677\t\n1678\t          </div>\n1679\t\n1680\t          <div class=\"pt-2 flex justify-end\">\n1681\t            <button id=\"done-settings-btn\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover text-white text-xs font-medium transition-colors shadow-sm\">Done</button>\n1682\t          </div>\n1683\t        </div>\n1684\t      `;\n1685\t\n1686\t      modal.querySelector('#close-settings-btn')?.addEventListener('click', () => modal.remove());\n1687\t      modal.querySelector('#done-settings-btn')?.addEventListener('click', () => modal.remove());\n1688\t      modal.addEventListener('click', e => { if (e.target === modal) modal.remove(); });\n1689\t\n1690\t      // Permission Mode logic\n1691\t      const permDescEl = modal.querySelector('#perm-desc');\n1692\t      const updatePermDesc = () => {\n1693\t        const val = state.permissionMode;\n1694\t        if (!val) permDescEl.textContent = 'null (SDK Default: Standard tool permission checks)';\n1695\t        else if (val === 'plan') permDescEl.textContent = '\"plan\" (Read-only: Read, Glob, Grep only)';\n1696\t        else if (val === 'bypassPermissions') permDescEl.textContent = '\"bypassPermissions\" (Full Access: All tool checks bypassed)';\n1697\t      };\n1698\t      updatePermDesc();\n1699\t\n1700\t      modal.querySelectorAll('.perm-option').forEach(btn => {\n1701\t        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1702\t          const val = btn.dataset.val;\n1703\t          state.permissionMode = val === 'default' ? null : val;\n1704\t          if (state.permissionMode) {\n1705\t            localStorage.setItem('qa-permission-mode', state.permissionMode);\n1706\t          } else {\n1707\t            localStorage.removeItem('qa-permission-mode');\n1708\t          }\n1709\t          modal.querySelectorAll('.perm-option').forEach(b => {\n1710\t            b.className = `perm-option py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${b.dataset.val === (state.permissionMode || 'default') ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}`;\n1711\t          });\n1712\t          updatePermDesc();\n1713\t        });\n1714\t      });\n1715\t\n1716\t      // Settings Sources logic\n1717\t      const sourceDescEl = modal.querySelector('#source-desc');\n1718\t      const updateSourceDesc = () => {\n1719\t        const s = state.settingSources;\n1720\t        if (!s) sourceDescEl.textContent = 'null (Loads user + project + local settings — SDK default)';\n1721\t        else if (s.includes('user')) sourceDescEl.textContent = '[\"user\"] (Only load ~/.claude/settings.json)';\n1722\t        else if (s.includes('local')) sourceDescEl.textContent = '[\"local\"] (Only load .claude/settings.local.json)';\n1723\t      };\n1724\t      updateSourceDesc();\n1725\t\n1726\t      modal.querySelectorAll('.source-option').forEach(btn => {\n1727\t        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1728\t          const val = btn.dataset.val;\n1729\t          if (val === 'default') {\n1730\t            state.settingSources = null;\n1731\t            localStorage.removeItem('qa-setting-sources');\n1732\t          } else if (val === 'user') {\n1733\t            state.settingSources = ['user'];\n1734\t            localStorage.setItem('qa-setting-sources', 'user');\n1735\t          } else if (val === 'local') {\n1736\t            state.settingSources = ['local'];\n1737\t            localStorage.setItem('qa-setting-sources', 'local');\n1738\t          }\n1739\t          const curVal = state.settingSources ? (state.settingSources.includes('user') ? 'user' : 'local') : 'default';\n1740\t          modal.querySelectorAll('.source-option').forEach(b => {\n1741\t            b.className = `source-option py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${b.dataset.val === curVal ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}`;\n1742\t          });\n1743\t          updateSourceDesc();\n1744\t        });\n1745\t      });\n1746\t\n1747\t      // Skills Configuration logic\n1748\t      const skillsContainer = modal.querySelector('#custom-skills-container');\n1749\t      const tagsList = modal.querySelector('#skills-tags-list');\n1750\t      const skillInput = modal.querySelector('#new-skill-input');\n1751\t      const addSkillBtn = modal.querySelector('#add-skill-btn');\n1752\t      const skillsDescEl = modal.querySelector('#skills-desc');\n1753\t\n1754\t      const renderSkillsTags = () => {\n1755\t        if (!tagsList) return;\n1756\t        tagsList.innerHTML = '';\n1757\t        const list = state.skillsList || [];\n1758\t        if (list.length === 0) {\n1759\t          tagsList.innerHTML = '<span class=\"text-[11px] text-txt-subtle italic p-1\">No custom skills added (sends empty list [])</span>';\n1760\t          return;\n1761\t        }\n1762\t        list.forEach((skillName, idx) => {\n1763\t          const tag = document.createElement('span');\n1764\t          tag.className = 'inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-dark-surface border border-dark-border text-white text-[11px] font-mono shadow-sm';\n1765\t          tag.innerHTML = `\n1766\t            <span>${escapeHtml(skillName)}</span>\n1767\t            <button type=\"button\" class=\"text-txt-subtle hover:text-red-400 font-sans ml-0.5 leading-none\" data-idx=\"${idx}\">&times;</button>\n1768\t          `;\n1769\t          tag.querySelector('button')?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1770\t            state.skillsList.splice(idx, 1);\n1771\t            localStorage.setItem('qa-skills-list', JSON.stringify(state.skillsList));\n1772\t            renderSkillsTags();\n1773\t            updateSkillsDesc();\n1774\t          });\n1775\t          tagsList.appendChild(tag);\n1776\t        });\n1777\t      };\n1778\t\n1779\t      const updateSkillsDesc = () => {\n1780\t        if (!skillsDescEl) return;\n1781\t        const mode = state.skillsMode || 'default';\n1782\t        if (mode === 'default') skillsDescEl.textContent = 'null (SDK default: standard CLI discovery)';\n1783\t        else if (mode === 'none') skillsDescEl.textContent = '[] (No skills at all: empty list)';\n1784\t        else if (mode === 'custom') {\n1785\t          const count = (state.skillsList || []).length;\n1786\t          skillsDescEl.textContent = `[${(state.skillsList || []).map(s => `\"${s}\"`).join(', ')}] (${count} skills enabled)`;\n1787\t        }\n1788\t      };\n1789\t\n1790\t      const addCustomSkill = () => {\n1791\t        const val = skillInput?.value.trim();\n1792\t        if (!val) return;\n1793\t        if (!state.skillsList) state.skillsList = [];\n1794\t        if (!state.skillsList.includes(val)) {\n1795\t          state.skillsList.push(val);\n1796\t          localStorage.setItem('qa-skills-list', JSON.stringify(state.skillsList));\n1797\t          renderSkillsTags();\n1798\t          updateSkillsDesc();\n1799\t        }\n1800\t        if (skillInput) skillInput.value = '';\n1801\t      };\n1802\t\n1803\t      addSkillBtn?.addEventListener('click', addCustomSkill);\n1804\t      skillInput?.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n1805\t        if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n1806\t          e.preventDefault();\n1807\t          addCustomSkill();\n1808\t        }\n1809\t      });\n1810\t\n1811\t      renderSkillsTags();\n1812\t      updateSkillsDesc();\n1813\t\n1814\t      modal.querySelectorAll('.skills-mode-btn').forEach(btn => {\n1815\t        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1816\t          const mode = btn.dataset.mode;\n1817\t          state.skillsMode = mode;\n1818\t          localStorage.setItem('qa-skills-mode', mode);\n1819\t\n1820\t          modal.querySelectorAll('.skills-mode-btn').forEach(b => {\n1821\t            b.className = `skills-mode-btn py-1 rounded transition-colors text-center ${b.dataset.mode === mode ? 'bg-brand text-white shadow-sm' : 'text-txt-subtle hover:text-white'}`;\n1822\t          });\n1823\t\n1824\t          if (mode === 'custom') {\n1825\t            skillsContainer?.classList.remove('hidden');\n1826\t          } else {\n1827\t            skillsContainer?.classList.add('hidden');\n1828\t          }\n1829\t          updateSkillsDesc();\n1830\t        });\n1831\t      });\n1832\t\n1833\t      // Speech explanation toggle logic\n1834\t      const speechToggle = modal.querySelector('#modal-speech-toggle');\n1835\t      speechToggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1836\t        state.speechExplanation = !state.speechExplanation;\n1837\t        localStorage.setItem('qa-speech-explanation', String(state.speechExplanation));\n1838\t        speechToggle.className = `relative inline-flex h-5 w-9 shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-full border-2 border-transparent transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out focus:outline-none ${state.speechExplanation ? 'bg-brand' : 'bg-dark-border'}`;\n1839\t        const span = speechToggle.querySelector('span');\n1840\t        if (span) span.className = `pointer-events-none inline-block h-4 w-4 transform rounded-full bg-white shadow ring-0 transition duration-200 ease-in-out ${state.speechExplanation ? 'translate-x-4' : 'translate-x-0'}`;\n1841\t      });\n1842\t\n1843\t      document.body.appendChild(modal);\n1844\t    }\n1845\t\n1846\t    // ============== Context Usage ==============\n1847\t    function updateContextBar(ctx) {\n1848\t      if (!el.contextUsageBar) return;\n1849\t      if (!ctx) {\n1850\t        el.contextUsageBar.classList.add('hidden');\n1851\t        el.contextUsageBar.classList.remove('flex');\n1852\t        return;\n1853\t      }\n1854\t      const pct = ctx.percentage || 0;\n1855\t      const totalBlocks = 20;\n1856\t      const filled = Math.min(totalBlocks, Math.max(0, Math.round((pct / 100) * totalBlocks)));\n1857\t      const empty = totalBlocks - filled;\n1858\t      if (el.contextUsageBlocks) {\n1859\t        el.contextUsageBlocks.innerHTML = `<span class=\"text-brand\">${'█'.repeat(filled)}</span><span class=\"text-brand/35\">${'░'.repeat(empty)}</span>`;\n1860\t      }\n1861\t      if (el.contextUsageLabel) {\n1862\t        el.contextUsageLabel.textContent = pct + '%';\n1863\t      }\n1864\t      el.contextUsageBar.classList.remove('hidden');\n1865\t      el.contextUsageBar.classList.add('flex');\n1866\t    }\n1867\t\n1868\t    function showContextModal() {\n1869\t      const ctx = state.contextUsage;\n1870\t      if (!ctx) return;\n1871\t      const max = ctx.maxTokens || 180000;\n1872\t\n1873\t      // Active categories (excluding free/inactive space)\n1874\t      const INACTIVE = ['Free space', 'Autocompact buffer'];\n1875\t      const activeCats = (ctx.categories || []).filter(c => !INACTIVE.includes(c.name));\n1876\t      const inactiveCats = (ctx.categories || []).filter(c => INACTIVE.includes(c.name));\n1877\t\n1878\t      const totalUsed = activeCats.reduce((s, c) => s + c.tokens, 0);\n1879\t      const pct = max > 0 ? Math.round(totalUsed / max * 100) : 0;\n1880\t      const totalFree = inactiveCats.reduce((s, c) => s + c.tokens, 0);\n1881\t\n1882\t      // Build category rows (active only)\n1883\t      const catRows = activeCats.map(c =>\n1884\t        `<tr><td class=\"py-1 px-2\">${c.name}</td><td class=\"py-1 px-2 text-right font-mono\">${c.tokens.toLocaleString()}</td><td class=\"py-1 px-2 text-right text-txt-subtle\">${max > 0 ? Math.round(c.tokens / max * 100) : 0}%</td></tr>`\n1885\t      ).join('');\n1886\t\n1887\t      const modal = document.createElement('div');\n1888\t      modal.id = 'context-modal';\n1889\t      modal.className = 'fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm';\n1890\t      modal.innerHTML = `\n1891\t        <div class=\"bg-dark-elevated border border-dark-border rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-80 max-h-[80vh] overflow-y-auto\">\n1892\t          <div class=\"p-4 border-b border-dark-border flex items-center justify-between\">\n1893\t            <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-txt-main\">Context Window</h3>\n1894\t            <button onclick=\"this.closest('#context-modal').remove()\" class=\"text-txt-subtle hover:text-txt-main\">\n1895\t              <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\"/></svg>\n1896\t            </button>\n1897\t          </div>\n1898\t          <div class=\"p-4\">\n1899\t            <div class=\"text-center mb-4\">\n1900\t              <div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-brand\">${totalUsed.toLocaleString()}</div>\n1901\t              <div class=\"text-xs text-txt-subtle\">of ${max.toLocaleString()} tokens (${pct}%)</div>\n1902\t              <div class=\"w-full h-2 bg-dark-bg rounded-full mt-2 overflow-hidden border border-dark-border/50\">\n1903\t                <div class=\"h-full bg-brand rounded-full\" style=\"width: ${pct}%\"></div>\n1904\t              </div>\n1905\t            </div>\n1906\t            <table class=\"w-full text-xs mb-4\">\n1907\t              <thead><tr class=\"text-txt-subtle border-b border-dark-border/50\"><th class=\"text-left py-1 px-2 font-medium\">Category</th><th class=\"text-right py-1 px-2 font-medium\">Tokens</th><th class=\"text-right py-1 px-2 font-medium\">%</th></tr></thead>\n1908\t              <tbody class=\"text-txt-main\">${catRows}</tbody>\n1909\t            </table>\n1910\t            <div class=\"border-t border-dark-border/50 pt-2\">\n1911\t              <div class=\"text-xs text-txt-subtle\">Free space: <strong class=\"text-txt-main font-mono\">${totalFree.toLocaleString()}</strong> tokens</div>\n1912\t            </div>\n1913\t          </div>\n1914\t        </div>\n1915\t      `;\n1916\t      modal.addEventListener('click', e => { if (e.target === modal) modal.remove(); });\n1917\t      document.body.appendChild(modal);\n1918\t    }\n1919\t\n1920\t    el.menuToggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1921\t      el.sidebar?.classList.toggle('-translate-x-full');\n1922\t      el.sidebarBackdrop?.classList.toggle('hidden');\n1923\t    });\n1924\t\n1925\t    el.sidebarBackdrop?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1926\t      el.sidebar?.classList.add('-translate-x-full');\n1927\t      el.sidebarBackdrop?.classList.add('hidden');\n1928\t    });\n1929\t\n1930\t    document.querySelectorAll('.prompt-chip').forEach(chip => {\n1931\t      chip.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1932\t        const text = chip.querySelector('.font-medium').textContent;\n1933\t        sendMessage(text);\n1934\t      });\n1935\t    });\n1936\t\n1937\t    // ============== Initialize ==============\n1938\t    async function init() {\n1939\t      await loadProjects();\n1940\t\n1941\t      if (state.currentThreadId) {\n1942\t        await selectSession(state.currentThreadId);\n1943\t      } else {\n1944\t        startNewChat();\n1945\t      }\n1946\t    }\n1947\t\n1948\t    init();\n1949\t  </script>\n1950\t</body>\n1951\t</html>\n1952\t\n1953\t"}]},{"role":"system","content":"<total_tokens>14999873 tokens left</total_tokens>"},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to understand how this frontend works. Let me analyze the structure. It's a fairly comprehensive single-page app. Let me summarize the key architecture.\n\nThis is a client-side frontend (`index.html`) that talks to a backend (`chat_server.py`) via REST + SSE (Server-Sent Events) streaming API. Let me understand the key pieces:\n\n**Overall architecture:**\n- Single HTML file with Tailwind CSS (CDN), marked.js (markdown), highlight.js (code), and vanilla JS app logic (no framework/bundler).\n- The backend is `chat_server.py` (a Python server, likely FastAPI given the `detail` fields in error responses).\n\n**Layout:**\n1. Sidebar (left, fixed, collapsible on mobile):\n   - Brand row \"Explainer Bot\" / \"Workspace Studio\"\n   - Projects section with expand/collapse/add buttons\n   - Project tree with sessions (conversations) nested under each project\n2. Main workspace:\n   - Header bar with menu toggle (mobile), \"QA Automation\" title, settings button\n   - Chat messages container (scrollable)\n   - Floating input container at bottom with context-usage bar and send button\n\n**State management:**\n- Global `state` object with projects, sessions, messages, currentThread, etc.\n- Some persisted to `localStorage` (current thread, active project, speech setting, sources, skills mode/skills list, permission mode).\n\n**API interactions (REST + SSE):**\n- `GET /api/projects` — load projects, auto-adds default workspace\n- `POST /api/projects` — add project (name, path)\n- `DELETE /api/projects/:id` — remove project\n- `GET /api/projects/:id/sessions` — load sessions for a project\n- `POST /api/chat` — streaming chat (SSE), with message, thread_id, project_id, speech_explanation, setting_sources, skills, permission_mode\n- `GET /api/sessions/:id/messages?limit=50&cursor=` — paginate old messages\n- `DELETE /api/sessions/:id` — delete session\n- `GET /api/workspace` — get workspace path\n\n**Streaming (SSE):**\n- `streamChat` parses Server-Sent Events: `event: X` / `data: {...}`\n- Events: `message` (with data.type: `human`, `context_usage`, `speech_explanation`, `text_delta`, `thinking_delta`, `tool_result`, other), `done`, `error`\n\n**Message types rendered:**\n- `human` — user message bubble\n- `ai` — markdown-rendered assistant response, with optional speech player + token usage badge\n- `thinking` — collapsible \"Thought Process\"\n- `tool`/`tool_result` — collapsible tool call display\n\n**Features:**\n- Text-to-speech (Web Speech API) — \"Listen Explanation\" button, speed control, transcript toggle\n- Markdown rendering with syntax highlighting\n- Context usage bar (token usage visualization) + context modal\n- Pagination (load older messages)\n- Settings modal: permission mode, settings sources, skills config, speech toggle\n- Projects & sessions management\n- Mobile responsive\n\nLet me give a concise summary. The user just said \"read it so you understand how it works.\" So they want me to confirm understanding, not make changes. I should give a tight summary of the architecture. No need for edits. I'll keep it concise but complete enough to show I understand it, and note it pairs with chat_server.py.\n\nLet me not over-explain. Give the key points.\n","signature":"77463d06e91a4dc68025b026a2c1a3cd"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nYes — read it end to end. Here's how it works.\n\n## Architecture\n\nIt's a **single static SPA** (`index.html`, ~1952 lines) with no build step or framework — just vanilla JS + Tailwind via CDN. It's the front end to [chat_server.py](home/web-h-063/Documents/explainer-bot/chat_server.py), which it talks to over REST + SSE (Server-Sent Events streaming). Three libs do the heavy lifting: **marked.js** (markdown → HTML), **highlight.js** (code syntax highlighting), **Tailwind** (theme — note the custom orange \"brand\" palette on a near-black dark theme).\n\n## Layout (3 panels)\n\n- **Sidebar** — \"Explainer Bot\" brand + a **Projects** tree. Each project holds nested **sessions** (conversations). Expand/collapse/add/delete all here.\n- **Header** — title \"QA Automation\", mobile menu toggle, and the **settings gear** (⚙).\n- **Chat area + floating input** — messages scroll container, and a glass bottom-input box with an auto-growing textarea, a **token/context usage bar**, and the Send button.\n\n## Data flow\n\nEverything routes through a global `state` object. It's split into **session state** (in-memory: projects, sessions, messages) and **persisted state** (`localStorage`: current thread, active project, speech toggle, setting sources, skills mode/list, permission mode).\n\n**API surface** it calls against the backend:\n\n| Endpoint | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `GET /api/projects` | Load projects — auto-creates a default one from `/api/workspace` |\n| `POST /api/projects`, `DELETE /api/projects/:id` | Manage projects (name + path) |\n| `GET /api/projects/:id/sessions` | Load a project's conversations |\n| `POST /api/chat` | **Streaming chat** (SSE) — the core |\n| `GET /api/sessions/:id/messages?limit=50&cursor=` | Pagination (load older) |\n| `DELETE /api/sessions/:id` | Delete a session |\n\n## The streaming core (`sendMessage` → `streamChat`)\n\n`POST /api/chat` streams SSE with fields `message, thread_id, project_id, speech_explanation, setting_sources, skills, permission_mode`. `streamChat` parses the `event:`/`data:` lines and dispatches by `data.type`:\n- `text_delta` — appends live to the assistant message body (debounced markdown re-render).\n- `thinking_delta` — streams into the collapsible **\"Thought Process\"** block.\n- `speech_explanation` — builds the **\"Listen Explanation\"** TTS player.\n- `tool_result` — renders the collapsible tool-call card (command + params + output).\n- `context_usage` — updates the token bar. `done` — finalizes, writes the AI message to state, refreshes the sidebar.\n- `error` — red error bubble. An `AbortController` handles cancellation / \"new chat\".\n\n## Notable features already wired up\n\n- **TTS** via the Web Speech API — play/pause, 1.0→2.0x speed cycling, transcript (\"Script\") toggle, one active player at a time.\n- **Markdown + highlighted code** rendering, token-usage badges, and a **context-window modal** with per-category token breakdown.\n- **Settings modal**: permission mode (default / read-only / bypass), settings sources (user / local / all), skills config (default / none / custom with tag input), speech toggle.\n- **Responsive** — sidebar collapses into a mobile overlay under 1024px; Enter sends on desktop, newline on mobile.\n\nSo it's a full agent chat client: it presents projects (source-control repos), loads their conversation history, and streams Claude Agent SDK tool-calls/thinking/speech back. It's purely the UI shell — the logic lives in `chat_server.py`.\n\nWant me to do anything with this — a change, a fix, or an audit?"}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text",